<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JOB" style="id">- Vidunda Bible version</book>
  <para style="h">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ayu</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ayubu</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Ayubu changusimila mbuli za munhu yawele nayali yomdumba Nguluwi yawele nakafichigwa na magazo makulu, ila munhu ayo haditile gehile kwa kumlonjeleza Nguluwi (Ayubu 1:22). Haduhu yoneche yalinguvizela whaani yawele nakandika chitabu cha Ayubu ama nachandichigwa kuli mhela wachi, ila yoweza kuwa Ayubu nakekala kuli mhela wa wasekulu kota Abulahamu, kwa vila Ayubu nakekala kwa mhela winji, uwele ndo miyaka miya imwe na makumi gane (140). Wasomile hawalingijesa kota Ayubu yuye ndo yawele nakandika chitabu achi. Yalingwandika yunji yawele halinguzeleka nakejesa kota inoga kuwasimila wanji mbuli ayi, ahyo nakandika mbuli ayi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Ayubu changuwala magazo. Limazoga nalikundizwa kumjeza Ayubu kwa magazo kwa vila nalijesa kota magazo ago gomdita Ayubu yaleche kumfugamila Nguluwi (Ayubu 1:12). Honhu hakulu ha chitabu achi hangusimila kuwala kulongasa koyawele nako Ayubu na goloko wa heye kuwala chiwalo cha kugazika kwa heye. Goloko wa Ayubu nawali wochijesa kota Ayubu nayali yogazika kwa chiwalo cha gehile goyaditile, ila Ayubu nayali yovizela kota nayali yalihela nongwa. Hamba, Nguluwi nakalongasa na Ayubu, ila Nguluwi hamlonjele lekachoni nakagazika ng'hatu kota vila. Ayubu loyavizele kota Nguluwi kanguweza kudita choneche choyalingugana na kota munhu howeza kugazela madito ga Nguluwi ga kububuwaza, nakatambichizwa kahi na Nguluwi kwa kupegwa lufufu lwinji na wana.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Sula ya 1 na 2 zangusimila mbuli za magazo makulu ga Ayubu gawele nagambuzwa na Limazoga.</para>
  <para style="io">2. Sula ya 3-37 zangusimila kuwala kulongasa kuwele nakulutilila hali Ayubu na goloko wa heye kuwala magazo ga heye.</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kuli sula ya 38-42:6 Nguluwi kangulongasa na Ayubu na Ayubu kangumwidichila Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="io">4. Kuli sula ya 42:7-17 yangusimila kuwala kikala kunji kwa Ayubu na ndaze Nguluwi vyoyamtambichize kuli kuduma.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JOB 1" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu na ivyazi lyake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 1:1" />Kuli isi ya Usi nakwali na munhu yawele nayali yochemigwa Ayubu. Munhu ayo nayali yalihela nongwa na nayali na hachi. Nayali yomdumba Nguluwi na nayali yochiwika kutali na gehile. <verse eid="JOB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 1:2" />Ayubu nayali na wana walume saba na wana wadala wadatu, <verse eid="JOB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 1:3" />kahi nayali na ming'holo elufu saba (7,000) na ngamiya elufu zidatu (3,000) na mibuguma elufu imwe (1,000) na midogowi midala miya zihano (500) na vitumagwa wenji ng'hatu. Nayali na lufufu lwinji kusinda wanhu weng'ha ako kolilawilaga isanya. <verse eid="JOB 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 1:4" />Wana walume wa Ayubu nawali wodita mnvina chila mhela, chila yumwe kuli zuwa lya heye. Nawali wowalalika walumbu wa hewo wadatu leka kulya na kunwa hamwe na hewo.<verse eid="JOB 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 1:5" />Chila mhela mnvina loisindile, Ayubu nayali yowachema wanage leka yawelize. Nayali yokwinuka lufuku ng'hatu leka kulavya nhambiko za kulakazwa kwa chiwalo cha chila yumwe wa hewo kwa vila nayali yochijesa, “Hanji wana wa heni nawadita gehile na kumliga Nguluwi mnhumbula zawo.”<verse eid="JOB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 1:6" />Zuwa limwe wahilisi wa Nguluwi nawaluta hali Mkulu Nguluwi, Limazoga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Limazoga </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kwa Chiebulaniya ayu kanguchemigwa Satani. Itagwa ali Satani lina mana ya mng'honyo ama yalingulonjeleza.</char></note> nalyo naliluta hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="JOB 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 1:7" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakaliuza Limazoga, “Nakulawa kohi?” Limazoga nalimwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi, “Ndangulawa kuzunguluta kuli isi yeng'ha ndijendajenda aku na kula.”<verse eid="JOB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 1:8" />Ahyo Mkulu Nguluwi nakalilonjela Limazoga, “Ndaze, nakumona chitumagwa wa heni Ayubu? Kuli isi yeng'ha haduhu yunji yawele kota heye. Heye ndo munhu yalihela nongwa na yawele na hachi na yalingundumba na yalingiwika kutali na gehile.” <verse eid="JOB 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 1:9" />Limazoga nalimwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi, “Ndaze, ayo Ayubu kangukudumba hegwe hihi hela? <verse eid="JOB 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 1:10" />Ndaze, haiwele kota hegwe kwangumwamila banzi zeng'ha hamwe na ng'handa ya heye na chila chinhu choyawele nacho? Nakujitambichiza mijito ja moko ga heye, ahyo nakuvidita vilundo vya heye vya ming'holo na mhene na migongolo ja heye jinji vyenele kuli isi yeng'ha. <verse eid="JOB 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 1:11" />Lelo ugolole moko wa hegwe na kusambalula chila chinhu choyawele nacho, ndikomya kokuliga.”<verse eid="JOB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 1:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalilonjela Limazoga “Lelo, koweza kudita choneche choulinguweza kuwala lufufu lwa heye, ila hawele yuye, uleche kumdoliza.” Lelo Limazoga nalyuka hali Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kujezigwa kwa mwaluko kwa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 1:13" />Zuwa limwe wana wa Ayubu lowawele wodita mnvina, wolya na kunwa divai kuli ng'handa ya mng'holozawo mkulu, <verse eid="JOB 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 1:14" />nakoya chitumagwa kwa Ayubu na kulonga, “Natwali tulima kwa mihuka ja kukwejigwa na mibuguma. Midogowi najo najali jilya aho habehi. <verse eid="JOB 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 1:15" />Wanhu kulawa Sheba nawatutowa na kujihola migongolo ajo. Hamba nawawakopola vitumagwa kwa ipanga, heni ndiliyeka nasulupuka kukugalila mbuli ayi!”<verse eid="JOB 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 1:16" />Loyawele yang'hali kusinda kulonga, nakoya yunji na kulonga, “Lumwemwesa lwa limlungu nalulakaza na kujikopola ming'holo na vitumagwa, heni ndiliyeka nasulupuka kukugalila mbuli ayi!”<verse eid="JOB 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 1:17" />Ayo naye loyawele yang'hali kusinda kulonga, nakoya yunji na kulonga, “Wakalidayo nawewika goya kuli vilundo vidatu, nawawavaba ngamiya wa hegwe na kuwahola. Nawawakopola vitumagwa kwa ipanga, ila heni ndiliyeka nasulupuka kukugalila mbuli ayi!”<verse eid="JOB 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 1:18" />Loyawele yang'hali yolonga, nakoya msenga yunji na kulonga, “Wana wa hegwe walume na wadala lowawele wolya na kunwa divai kuli ng'handa ya mng'holozawo mkulu, <verse eid="JOB 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 1:19" />baho du chivuluvumbi kulawa kuchiwala nachiitowa ng'handa ayo chila ubanzi, nayo naiwagwila, wana wa hegwe weng'ha nawabagama, heni ndiliyeka nasulupuka kukugalila mbuli ayi!”<verse eid="JOB 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 1:20" />Ayubu nakema, nakadega mivalo ja heye na kubeya mnvili za heye kwa masinzo, hamba naketoza hanyi na kumfugamila Nguluwi. <verse eid="JOB 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 1:21" />Nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">“Nandawa kuli lida lya mayangu mbele mwanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">ndohiluka mbele mwanzi hihila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">Mkulu Nguluwi nakahola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 1:21">itagwa lya Mkulu Nguluwi litogoligwe.”<verse eid="JOB 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 1:22" />Kuli mbuli azo zeng'ha Ayubu haditile gehile kwa kumlonjeleza Nguluwi kwa kumditila mbuli zihile.<verse eid="JOB 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JOB 2" />
  <para style="s">Kujezigwa kwa keli kwa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 2:1" />Zuwa liyage wahilisi wa Nguluwi nawaluta hali Mkulu Nguluwi, Limazoga nalyo nalyali hamwe na hewo. <verse eid="JOB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 2:2" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakaliuza Limazoga, “Nakulawa kohi?” Limazoga nalimwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi, “Ndangulawa kuzunguluta kuli isi yeng'ha ndijendajenda aku na kula.” <verse eid="JOB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 2:3" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalilonjela Limazoga, “Ndaze, nakumona chitumagwa wa heni Ayubu? Kuli isi yeng'ha haduhu yunji yawele kota heye. Heye ndo munhu yalihela nongwa na yawele na hachi na yalingundumba na yalingiwika kutali na gehile. Kangulutilila na kukundigwa kwa heye, hanga nakundedeza ndimuwifye ne chiwalo.” <verse eid="JOB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 2:4" />Limazoga nalimwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi, “Kangulutilila na kukundigwa kwa vila nakulutambichiza lukuli lwa heye! Munhu kangulavyaga chila chinhu choyawele nacho leka yalohole ukomu wa heye. <verse eid="JOB 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 2:5" />Lelo ugolole moko wa hegwe leka utowe lukuli lwa heye na mizeje ja heye, ndangukomya kokuliga.”<verse eid="JOB 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 2:6" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalilonjela Limazoga, “Ena, koweza kumditila choneche choulingugana, ila uleche kumkopola.” <verse eid="JOB 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 2:7" />Ahyo Limazoga nalyuka hali Mkulu Nguluwi, nalyo nalimgaza Ayubu kwa mipu jihile kuli lukuli lweng'ha kulawa kuli uzayo mbaka kumutwi. <verse eid="JOB 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 2:8" />Ayubu nakekalisa kuli mivu kwa chiwalo cha kulombocheza, hamba nakahola igaye na kizada kwa alyo igaye. <verse eid="JOB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 2:9" />Mchewake nakamlonjela, “Ndaze, kwangulutilila kibatilila kukundigwa kwa hegwe? Umlige Nguluwi, ubagame!”<verse eid="JOB 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 2:10" />Ayubu nakamwidichila mchewake, “Kwangulonga kota vyoyawele mdala mpoka. Ndaze, tubochele ganojile hela kulawa kwa Nguluwi, tuleche kubochela gehile?” Kuli mbuli azo zeng'ha Ayubu haditile gehile kuli kulonga kwa heye.<verse eid="JOB 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Goloko wadatu wa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 2:11" />Goloko wadatu wa Ayubu wawele ndo Elifasi, Mtemani na Bilidadi, Mshuhi na Sofali, Mnaama, nawahulika kuwala magazo geng'ha gawele nagamfika Ayubu. Lelo nawamula kulawa kuli ng'handa za hewo na kuluta kwa Ayubu leka kumkangaza nhumbula. <verse eid="JOB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 2:12" />Lowamuwene kwa kutali nawalemwela kumzela kota ndo Ayubu. Lelo, nawaluka kulila kwa lizi likulu na kudadula mivalo ja hewo na kuwika nhimbwisi kuli vitwi vya hewo kwa masinzo. <verse eid="JOB 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 2:13" />Hamba nawekalisa hamwe na Ayubu kuli misanga kwa mazuwa saba. Haduhu yoneche hali hewo yawele nakalongasa na Ayubu, kwa vila nawagona magazo ga heye vyogawele makulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JOB 3" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangulipanjila zuwa lyoyapondigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 3:1" />Loukolile mhela umwenga, Ayubu nakalonga kwa kulipanjila zuwa lyoyapondigwe. <verse eid="JOB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 3:2" />Nakalonga,<verse eid="JOB 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 3:3" />“Lipanjilwe zuwa lila liwele namhondigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:3">mbaka nechilo yila iwele nailonjigwa, ‘Kana himila ya mwana mlume!’<verse eid="JOB 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 3:4" />Zuwa alyo liwe jiza!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">Nguluwi kilanga yaleche kitunya kwa chiwalo cha zuwa alyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:4">ne lumuli lwoneche luleche kulangazila kuli zuwa alyo!<verse eid="JOB 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 3:5" />Jiza totolo ilifiche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">ng'hungugu ng'hulu ziligubiche.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:5">Utitu ugubiche lumuli lwake!<verse eid="JOB 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 3:6" />Nechilo yila ibatigwe na jiza totolo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">Ileche kuwazigwa kuli mazuwa ga mwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:6">ne kuwazigwa kuli mazuwa ga mwezi woneche.<verse eid="JOB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 3:7" />Ena, nechilo ayo iwe mhende,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:7">lizi lya kusangalala lileche kuhulikwa mgati mwake.<verse eid="JOB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 3:8" />Wala walingugapanjilaga mazuwa, walipanjile zuwa alyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:8">wala wawele goya kulinula linhu likulu, Lewiyatani.<verse eid="JOB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 3:9" />Nhondwe zake za lufuku zigubikwe na jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">libeteze lumuli ne kulawila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:9">ne kona lumuli lya kubwemwenzuka,<verse eid="JOB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 3:10" />kwa vila nechilo ayo haiwopile munda wa mayangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:10">ne kugavisa magazo leka ndeche kugona.<verse eid="JOB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 3:11" />“Lekachoni sibagame lomhondigwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:11">Lekachoni sibagame lombele ndilawa mmunda?<verse eid="JOB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 3:12" />Lekachoni mayangu nakamhonda?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:12">Lekachoni mayangu nakonyeza heni?<verse eid="JOB 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 3:13" />Kwa vila lelo ndahawele nyesele kwa kikala goya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:13">Ndahawele mbasile na kwesela,<verse eid="JOB 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 3:14" />hamwe na wandewa na vilongozi wa isi wawele nawabagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:14">wawele nawezenjela ng'handa za hewo, ziwele sambi ndo mahame.<verse eid="JOB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 3:15" />Ndahawele hamwe na vilongozi wawele na zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:15">wawele nawazimemeza ng'handa za hewo kwa sendi.<verse eid="JOB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 3:16" />Lekachoni siwele kota himila iwifigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:16">ena kota mwana yawele nakapondigwa yawele nakabagama?<verse eid="JOB 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 3:17" />Ako kuli kubagama, wehile hawalingumtunya munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:17">watochile wangwesela.<verse eid="JOB 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 3:18" />Ako wanweng'hwa wangwesela hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:18">hawalinguhulika lizi lya kung'ang'ala lya chilongozi wa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 3:19" />Wakulu na wadodo wa kuko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:19">nawo wapogozi nawaditigwa wawe na kilejeha kulawa kwa wakulu wawo.<verse eid="JOB 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 3:20" />“Lekachoni kumha lumuli yula yawele kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:20">kumha ukomu yula yawele na masinzo mnhumbula?<verse eid="JOB 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 3:21" />Munhu yalingugana kubagama ila halingubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:21">kangupalaga kubagama kusinda kupala ng'hano ivisigwe.<verse eid="JOB 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 3:22" />Munhu kota ayo kotowa luchenze ng'hatu na kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:22">kosangalala hoyobagama na kutiligwa!<verse eid="JOB 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 3:23" />Lekachoni kumha ukomu munhu yawele nzila za heye nazihindigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:23">munhu yawele Nguluwi nakamzungulusila mbaka?<verse eid="JOB 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 3:24" />Kwa vila kulila kwa heni kwa usungu kwanguya honhu ha chilyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:24">kung'ung'uta kwa heni kwangubohoka kota mazi.<verse eid="JOB 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 3:25" />Chila chondilinguchidumba nachifika kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:25">chinhu chiwele nachali chikabusa heni ndo chombele nacho.<verse eid="JOB 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 3:26" />Ndahela kikala goya ne kusindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 3:26">ndahela kwesela ila magazo yeka.”<verse eid="JOB 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JOB 4" />
  <para style="s">Elifasi kangwaluka kulongasa na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 4:1" />Hamba Elifasi, Mtemani, nakamwidichila Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 4:2" />“Wone munhu kojeza kulongasa na hegwe, komwimilila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:2">Ila whaani yoweza kilemeza kulonga?<verse eid="JOB 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 4:3" />Uhulichize! Hegwe nakuwalangusa wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:3">na kugadita moko ga ng'hochele gawe nzinzili.<verse eid="JOB 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 4:4" />Ulonzi wa hegwe nauwenula wawele nawatweguka nhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:4">nakugadita mafugamilo ga walihela mong'ho gawe nzinzili.<verse eid="JOB 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 4:5" />Ila lelo nagakufika, nagwe nakulemwela kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:5">nagakudoliza, nagwe nakudeula.<verse eid="JOB 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 4:6" />Ndaze, kumdumba Nguluwi na kugoloka kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:6">haviwele ndo kitumbila kwa hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 4:7" />Wijese lelo, whaani yalihela nongwa yawele nakawifigwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:7">Ama kohi wagoloche nawawahika kudumigwa?<verse eid="JOB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 4:8" />Vyondivizelele, walingulima na kunyala gehile na wihe wangubetaga gago du.<verse eid="JOB 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 4:9" />Nguluwi kanguwakopolaga awo kwa lweselo lwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:9">wangulakazwaga kwa chiluli cha ng'halazi ya heye.<verse eid="JOB 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 4:10" />Wehile wangubumaga kota isimba ling'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:10">ila mizino jawo jangubenigwa.<verse eid="JOB 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 4:11" />Isimba liwele na mong'ho lyangubagamaga wone liwe lilihela upelembi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:11">na miyana ja isimba idala jangusambalukaga!”<verse eid="JOB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 4:12" />“Zuwa limwe nandonjeligwa ulonzi kwa uviso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:12">ikutu lya heni nalihulika kupwepwa kwake.<verse eid="JOB 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 4:13" />Lombele kuli kulota mhela wa nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:13">mhela uwele usinjinzi wanguwabataga wanhu,<verse eid="JOB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 4:14" />nandali ndidumba na kukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:14">mizeje ja heni jeng'ha najali jikakama.<verse eid="JOB 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 4:15" />Muhe naukola kumeho kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:15">mnvili za lukuli lwa heni nazima.<verse eid="JOB 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 4:16" />Nawima tulu hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">londolile nasivizelele.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">Nakwali na ulajilo hali heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:16">nakwali tulu, hamba nanyulika lizi,<verse eid="JOB 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 4:17" />‘Munhu koweza kuwa yatanganiche kusinda Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:17">Ndaze, munhu koweza kuwa yelile kusinda Yamlumbile?<verse eid="JOB 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 4:18" />Wone Nguluwi kahela kitumbila kwa vitumagwa wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:18">mbaka kanguwang'ung'utila wahilisi wa heye kwa kudita vibi,<verse eid="JOB 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 4:19" />yowa ndaze lelo kwa wanhu wawele nawalumbigwa kwa misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">wanhu wawele mwaluko wa hewo ndo nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:19">wawele woweza kuhondangwa kota fukuzi?<verse eid="JOB 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 4:20" />Kwa mhela uchefu hela munhu kodumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:20">kokwajilila mazuwa gose ne kuleka ulajilo wa heye!<verse eid="JOB 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 4:21" />Wone uzi ulingibatilila ukomu wa hewo udumuligwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 4:21">wangubagama ne kuwa na luhala.’<verse eid="JOB 4:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JOB 5" />
  <para style="s">Elifasi kangulutilila kulonga</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 5:1" />“Ucheme lelo, ulole leka wone kota hana wa kukwidichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:1">Whaani hali wahilisi yawele kokutanza?<verse eid="JOB 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 5:2" />Ndangukomya, ng'halazi yangumkopolaga mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:2">na fihi yangumdumyaga.<verse eid="JOB 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 5:3" />Nandimona mpoka yolutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:3">ila baho du nandiipanjila ng'handa ya heye.<verse eid="JOB 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 5:4" />Wana wa heye wa kutali na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">chila mhela wangubunzwa kuli chitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:4">haduhu munhu wa kuwalewela.<verse eid="JOB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 5:5" />Mbena za heye wangulyaga wawele na nzala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">mbaka nyhule ziwele hali miwa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:5">Wawele na maya wangulugana lufufu lwa heye.<verse eid="JOB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 5:6" />Kwa vila magazo hagalingulawa kuli nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:6">ne kugazigwa hakulingulawa kuli misanga.<verse eid="JOB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 5:7" />Ila munhu kangupondigwa leka yafichigwe na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:7">kota misesela ja chiluli vyojilinguzuma kulutila kuchanya.<verse eid="JOB 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 5:8" />“Kota ndahawele hegwe ndahamgalamchile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:8">ndahalandile kutanzigwa na heye,<verse eid="JOB 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 5:9" />heye yalingudita mbuli ng'hulu za kububuwaza zohambe zipugajizwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:9">yalingudita vinduzanduza vyohambe viwazigwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 5:10" />Kanguitowelega isi nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:10">kangugahilikaga mazi kuli migunda.<verse eid="JOB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 5:11" />Kanguwenulaga wawele ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:11">walingulombocheza kanguwapaga kikala goya.<verse eid="JOB 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 5:12" />Kangubenaga kiwika goya kwa wahadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:12">leka mbuli za hewo zileche kulutilila goya.<verse eid="JOB 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 5:13" />Kanguwagwilizaga wawele na luhala kuli wihe wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:13">na kanguwifyaga baho du kiwika goya kwa wasugu.<verse eid="JOB 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 5:14" />Wangonaga jiza kuli mhela wa isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:14">kuli mhela wa nemisi wangukwabasa kota vila nechilo.<verse eid="JOB 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 5:15" />Ila Nguluwi kanguwaloholaga walihela utanzi, kulawa kuli ulonzi ung'hang'hale wa wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:15">kanguwanyasulaga wazunwa kulawa kuli moko ga walingubunza.<verse eid="JOB 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 5:16" />Ahyo ng'hochele wana kitumbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:16">wehile wanguditigwa wanyamalile.<verse eid="JOB 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 5:17" />“Nakatambichizwa yula yalingukanyigwa na Nguluwi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:17">Ahyo uleche kubeza houkanyigwa na Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="JOB 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 5:18" />Kwa vila heye kanguwikaga vilonda, kahi kanguviwopaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:18">kangulumizaga, ila moko wa heye wanguloholaga.<verse eid="JOB 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 5:19" />Kokulohola kuli kubagama mzidi wa hamwande,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:19">kuli magazo ga kuduma, wihe hauweza kukudoliza.<verse eid="JOB 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 5:20" />Mhela wa lufemba kokulohola kulawa kuli kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:20">kuli ngondo kokulohola kulawa kuli ipanga.<verse eid="JOB 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 5:21" />Kokwamilwa goya kulawa kuli kutowigwa kwa umyango wa wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:21">kudumya hokukuyila, haudumba.<verse eid="JOB 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 5:22" />Kudumya na lufemba hovikuya kwa hegwe, koseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:22">migongolo jing'hang'hale ja kisolo hojikuya kwa hegwe, haudumba.<verse eid="JOB 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 5:23" />Migunda joulingulima jowa jilihela maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:23">najo migongolo ja kisolo jowa na kikala goya na hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 5:24" />Kovizela kota ihema lya hegwe lya kuli kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:24">kokagula lufufu lwa hegwe, kovizela kota chila chinhu cha baho.<verse eid="JOB 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 5:25" />Kovizela kota wana wa hegwe wowa wenji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:25">walelwa wa hegwe wowa wenji kota misolo ja kuli isi.<verse eid="JOB 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 5:26" />Kobagama uwele sekulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:26">kota miso ja ngano jiwele najikungajizwa kuli mhela wa mbena.<verse eid="JOB 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 5:27" />Natuipugajiza goya mbuli ayi, nayo ndo ya kukomya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 5:27">Ahyo uihulichize na uikolele mijito.”<verse eid="JOB 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JOB 6" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Elifasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 6:1" />Hamba Ayubu nakamwidichila Elifasi,<verse eid="JOB 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 6:2" />“Wone usungu wa heni wahapimigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:2">magazo ga heni geng'ha gahawichigwe kuli mizani,<verse eid="JOB 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 6:3" />gahawele na itunyo ng'hatu kusinda sangalaza za kuli bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:3">acho ndo chiwalo cha heni kulonga hela ne kijesa!<verse eid="JOB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 6:4" />Misale ja Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali najisoma lukuli lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">nhumbula ya heni nainwa dunga yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:4">ukabuso wa Nguluwi wangiwika goya kufika heni.<verse eid="JOB 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 6:5" />Ndaze, idogowi lya kisolo lyangulilaga wone liwe na misolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:5">ama ibuguma lyangulilaga wone liwe na chilyo?<verse eid="JOB 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 6:6" />Ndaze, chilyo chizabuche choligwa ne mwino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:6">ama hana unonile kuli ute wa ifinga?<verse eid="JOB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 6:7" />Silingugana kuvidoliza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:7">vilyo viwele kota ahi vyangunzudizaga.”<verse eid="JOB 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 6:8" />“Wone ndahapatile chondandile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:8">wone Nguluwi yahamhele chila chondilingitumbila,<verse eid="JOB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 6:9" />kota Nguluwi yahawele goya kumhondanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:9">yahagolole moko wa heye leka yang'hopole!<verse eid="JOB 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 6:10" />Acho chahawele ndo chihembulizo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">ndahasangalale kuli usungu wohauwele na isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:10">kwa vila siulemile ulonzi wa heye Yelile.<verse eid="JOB 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 6:11" />Ndina mong'ho whachi mbaka ndutilile kitumbila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:11">Kuduma kwa heni kowa ndaze mbaka ndutilile kwimilila?<verse eid="JOB 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 6:12" />Ndaze, ndoweza kwimilila kota iganga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:12">Ama lukuli lwa heni ndo kota chuma?<verse eid="JOB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 6:13" />Ndikomya, siweza kitanza ndiliyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:13">utanzi weng'ha nawusigwa kwa heni.”<verse eid="JOB 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 6:14" />“Yohambe yamlajile goloko wa heye igano lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:14">kangulema kumdumba Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="JOB 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 6:15" />Goloko wa heni nawambada kota nzanda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:15">nawandeteleza kota vikolola visowile mazi,<verse eid="JOB 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 6:16" />viwele vimemile balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:16">na seluji yanguwa ivisile mgati mwake.<verse eid="JOB 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 6:17" />Ila mhela wa ivuche yangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:17">nzanda zangusigala ng'havu.<verse eid="JOB 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 6:18" />Wawele kuli majendo wangusochelaga nzila wopala mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:18">wanguluta kuchiwala na wangubagama kuko.<verse eid="JOB 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 6:19" />Wawele kuli majendo kulawa Tema wangugapalaga mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:19">walingugula na kuguza vinhu wa Sheba walingujenda, wangubeteza kwa kitumbila.<verse eid="JOB 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 6:20" />Wangitunyaga kwa kitumbila kwa hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:20">wangufika kuli nzanda azo na kona haduhu chowawele wochitumbila.<verse eid="JOB 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 6:21" />Namwe namuwa kota nzanda azo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:21">mwangugona magazo ga heni na kudumba.<verse eid="JOB 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 6:22" />Ndaze, nandonga mumhe heni chonolo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:22">Ama chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kwajiliza hachi kulawa kuli lufufu lwa hemwe?<verse eid="JOB 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 6:23" />Ama mndohole kulawa kuli ndole za mng'honyo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:23">Ama mngombole kulawa mmoko mwa mwihe?”<verse eid="JOB 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 6:24" />“Mndanguse nani ndonyamalila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:24">mnzelese ndaze vyondajilile.<verse eid="JOB 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 6:25" />Ulonzi wa kukomya una mong'ho ng'hatu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:25">Ila kung'hanuchila kwa hemwe kwangundangusa choni?<verse eid="JOB 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 6:26" />Ndaze, mwangijesa kota mwanguweza kugolola ulonzi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:26">Ulonzi wa munhu yagozole ndo kota mbeho hela.<verse eid="JOB 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 6:27" />Mna nhumbula zigagadale mbaka mwanguwatowela simbi walekwa leka wawe wapogozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:27">ena, mbaka mwangumguza goloko wa hemwe!<verse eid="JOB 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 6:28" />Dedede lelo mndole heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:28">siweza kulonga udesi hali hemwe.<verse eid="JOB 6:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 6:29" />Dedede, haleche kuwa na wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:29">mleche kundonjeleza, kwa vila ulonzi wa heni ndo wa hachi.<verse eid="JOB 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 6:30" />Ndaze, mwangijesa kota nandonga udesi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 6:30">Silingulonga udesi, kwa vila ndanguvizela linojile na lihile.<verse eid="JOB 6:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JOB 7" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumng'ung'utila Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 7:1" />“Munhu kana mijito jing'hang'hale ng'hatu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:1">mazuwa ga heye ndo kota gala ga mkola mijito!<verse eid="JOB 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 7:2" />Heye ndo kota chitumagwa yawele na maya ga lubehelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:2">ama mkola mijito yalingubeteza chinhu choyalinguganigwa kupegwa kwa chiwalo cha mijito joyakolile.<verse eid="JOB 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 7:3" />Lelo namhegwa myezi na myezi ja hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:3">kwa heni ndo masinzo nechilo nyinji.<verse eid="JOB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 7:4" />Hondiwasa ndangulonga, ‘Ndokwinuka nili?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">Kwa vila mhela wa nechilo wanguwa ukulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:4">ndangugalawata mchinhanda mbaka mhela wa kubwemwenzuka!<verse eid="JOB 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 7:5" />Lukuli lwa heni nalumema mhiko na wavu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:5">na ngozi ya heni yangulavya ufila wa lipu.<verse eid="JOB 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 7:6" />Mazuwa ga heni gangumala kota mazi kuli ibuli litubuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:6">nago gangufika kuduma ne kuwa na kitumbila.<verse eid="JOB 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 7:7" />“Ukumbuchile, kikala kwa heni ndo kwa mhela udo hela kota lweselo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:7">iziho lya heni halilola linojile lyoneche kahi.<verse eid="JOB 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 7:8" />Yalingumbona sambi, hombona kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:8">wone undole, ndowa haduhu.<verse eid="JOB 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 7:9" />Kota ng'hungugu vyoilinguka na kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:9">ndo hihyo du, kwa munhu yalingudulika kuli isi ya wabagame ne kuhiluka.<verse eid="JOB 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 7:10" />Hohiluka kahi haluga ha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:10">naye kosemwigwa himahima.<verse eid="JOB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 7:11" />Ahyo siweza kulemeza mlomo wa heni kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">ndolonga kwa kiwhana na usungu wa muhe wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:11">ndong'ung'uta kwa usungu wa nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 7:12" />“Ndaze, heni nda bahali ama izoka likulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">lilingikala mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:12">mbaka umbichile wamizi leka ndeche kusulupuka?<verse eid="JOB 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 7:13" />Hondilonga kota chinhanda cha heni chondita nyesele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:13">honhu ha heni ha kuwasa homhunguzila kung'ung'uta kwa heni,<verse eid="JOB 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 7:14" />nagwe kwanguya kundumbiza kwa lunhwinhwi kuli kulota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:14">kwangung'habusa kwa kingalila ulaguzi,<verse eid="JOB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 7:15" />ahyo ndangona fola kikopola kwa kininiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:15">fola kubagama kusinda kufichigwa na magazo aga.<verse eid="JOB 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 7:16" />Ndangukuzudila kikala kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">sichikala mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:16">Mndeche, kwa vila mazuwa ga heni ndo lweselo hela!<verse eid="JOB 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 7:17" />Munhu ndo chinhu chachi mbaka umganilile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:17">Lekachoni kwangijesa ng'hatu kuwala heye?<verse eid="JOB 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 7:18" />Hegwe kwanguya kumlola chila hamitondo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:18">na chila mhela kwangumjeza!<verse eid="JOB 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 7:19" />Kolutilila kundola mbaka nili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:19">ne kundeka kwa mhela uchefu wa kwesela?<verse eid="JOB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 7:20" />Wone ndina gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">gangukuwifya choni, gwa mlolezi wa munhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Lekachoni nakumbika leka ndiwe honhu ha hegwe ha kutowa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:20">Ndaze, heni nandiwa itunyo lya hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 7:21" />Lekachoni haulingulechela nongwa za heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">na kumbusila gehile ga heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">Mhela uchefu ndotiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 7:21">komhala, ila ndowa haduhu!”<verse eid="JOB 7:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JOB 8" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kangulonga kota Ayubu kanguganigwa kulonga gehile ga heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 8:1" />Hamba Bilidadi, Mshuhi, nakamwidichila Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 8:2" />“Kolonga mbuli azi mbaka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:2">Mbaka nili ulonzi wa hegwe wowa wa hihi hela kota mbeho?<verse eid="JOB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 8:3" />Ndaze, Nguluwi kangwajilizaga utaguso?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:3">Ndaze, Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali kangwajilizaga hachi?<verse eid="JOB 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 8:4" />Wana wa hegwe lowaditile gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:4">nakawapa magazo kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 8:5" />Wone kompala Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:5">na kumdedeza Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,<verse eid="JOB 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 8:6" />na wone kahi kwahela nongwa na nakugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">ndangukomya, Nguluwi kokuya kwa hegwe kukutanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:6">kokudita kikala kwa hegwe kwa hachi kulutilile goya.<verse eid="JOB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 8:7" />Hanga mwaluko wa hegwe nawali ng'hochele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:7">ila kuduma kwa hegwe kowa kunojile ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 8:8" />Dedede wilanguse kwa wala watulongole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:8">leka wone wasekulu wa hewo nawelangusa choni,<verse eid="JOB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 8:9" />kwa vila hetwe natupondigwa mhela wuwu hela, hatuvizelele choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:9">nago mazuwa ga hetwe kuli isi ndo kota lubehelo hela.<verse eid="JOB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 8:10" />Kwa vila hewo wokulangusa na kukulonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:10">mbuli zilingulawa kuli uwanzi wa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 8:11" />Ndaze minyi joweza kota honhu halihela nzasa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:11">Midete joweza kukula goya ne mazi?<verse eid="JOB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 8:12" />Wone mazi gakale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">hanga jowa jing'hali kukangala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:12">jangukalaga himahima kusinda misolo jinji.<verse eid="JOB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 8:13" />Aku ndo vyokuwa kuduma kwa weng'ha walingumsemwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:13">hihyo du, kitumbila kwa wala wohambe wamkunde Nguluwi kodumigwa.<verse eid="JOB 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 8:14" />Kitumbila kwa hewo kwangubenekanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:14">ndo kota utandawala wa ibui.<verse eid="JOB 8:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 8:15" />Wanguwegamila utandawala wa hewo, ila hambe wime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:15">wanguubatililaga ila haulingikala kwa mhela winji.<verse eid="JOB 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 8:16" />Wohambe wamkunde Nguluwi ndo kota migodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">jiwele najitowelwa goya na nhonya kuli mhela wa chipalangule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:16">jokweneza mizuchila jake kuli kagunda keng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 8:17" />Mizabi jake jangipetela ng'hatu kuli maganga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:17">na kuli chila italawe.<verse eid="JOB 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 8:18" />Ila wone jing'humbuligwe kulawa honhu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:18">janguwa jilihela honhu ha kikala.<verse eid="JOB 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 8:19" />Lole, ako ndo kuduma kwa migodi ajo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">na honhu hake jozuka migodi jinji.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:19">Yowa kota ahyo kahi kwa wanhu wohambe wamkunde Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 8:20" />“Lole! Nguluwi homlema munhu yali hela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:20">kahi howatanza wehile.<verse eid="JOB 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 8:21" />Ila koumemeza mlomo wa hegwe kusechelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:21">mlomo wa hegwe lizi lya usangalalo.<verse eid="JOB 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 8:22" />Wala walingukuzudila wobasigwa soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 8:22">najo mihema ja wehile hajiwa baho kahi.”<verse eid="JOB 8:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JOB 9" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 9:1" />Hamba Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 9:2" />“Ndangukomya, ndanguvizela ahi ndo vyoiwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:2">ila munhu koweza ndaze kutawiza kota kana hachi hali Nguluwi?<verse eid="JOB 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 9:3" />Wone munhu yahajezile kitwanza na Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:3">yahalemwele kumwidichila hanga mala imwe hela hali kuuza elufu imwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 9:4" />Heye ndo yawele na luhala lwinji na mong'ho ng'hatu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:4">Whaani yawele naketwanza na heye na kusumya?<verse eid="JOB 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 9:5" />Heye kanguvyusaga vidunda ne vidunda avyo kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:5">kanguvigalamlaga kwa ng'halazi ya heye.<verse eid="JOB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 9:6" />Kangulilajizaga limachinyhina kuitigasa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:6">na kwambuza mizengo ja isi kutigasika.<verse eid="JOB 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 9:7" />Kangulajizaga na isanya lyanguleka kupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:7">na nhondwe zileche kulangaza.<verse eid="JOB 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 9:8" />Heye yaliyeka nakautandazula ulanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:8">na kuzidita nhigu za bahali zisindamale.<verse eid="JOB 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 9:9" />Ndo yaviditile vilundo vya nhondwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:9">vilinguchemigwa Idubu na Olioni na Kilimia na nhondwe za kusini.<verse eid="JOB 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 9:10" />Kanguditaga vinduzanduza vikulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:10">na mbuli zilingububuwaza zohambe ziwazigwe.<verse eid="JOB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 9:11" />Kangukolaga habehi na heni, silingumonaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:11">kangujendaga hali heni, silingumzela.<verse eid="JOB 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 9:12" />Lole! Kanguholaga choyalingugana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">whaani yoweza kumlemeza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:12">Whaani yoweza kumuuza, ‘Kwangudita choni?’ ”<verse eid="JOB 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 9:13" />“Ng'halazi ya Nguluwi loiwele ing'ang'ale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:13">vitumagwa wa Lahabu, chilumbigwe chikulu cha kuli bahali, nawagwa hali magulu ga heye.<verse eid="JOB 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 9:14" />Ndoweza ndaze kitwanza na Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:14">Ndaze, ndoweza kuhagula ulonzi wa kumlonjela?<verse eid="JOB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 9:15" />Hanga ndahela nongwa, siweza kumwidichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">Ndanguganigwa kumdedeza ayo yalingundonjeleza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:15">leka yambonele isungu.<verse eid="JOB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 9:16" />Hanga ndahamchemile kuli chitala na yahakundile kuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:16">silingukunda kota yahanyhulichize.<verse eid="JOB 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 9:17" />Kangundumyaga kwa chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:17">na konjeza vilonda kwa heni ne chiwalo.<verse eid="JOB 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 9:18" />Halingundeka nyesele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:18">ila kangumemeza heni usungu.<verse eid="JOB 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 9:19" />Wone ndo kuwala kitwanza, heye kana mong'ho ng'hatu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">Wone ndo kuwala kupala hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:19">whaani yawele komhilika kuli chitala?<verse eid="JOB 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 9:20" />Hanga ndahawele ndilihela nongwa, ulonzi wa heni wahanyambuze kuwa na nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:20">hanga ndahawele siditile gehile, wahatawize kota nandajilila.<verse eid="JOB 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 9:21" />Hanga ndahela nongwa, silingijesa kuwala chilingulawila kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:21">ndangukuzudila kikala kwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 9:22" />Nguluwi kanguwakopolaga walihela nongwa na wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:22">ahyo, haduhu chilingunhanza.<verse eid="JOB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 9:23" />Mhela uwele kubagama hokuya baho du,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:23">kangusechelelaga kubagama kwa yalihela nongwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 9:24" />Isi hoiwa kuli ulongozi wa wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Nguluwi kangugadinyaga meho ga watagusa wa heye!”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:24">Wone hawele heye yalingudita ahyo, kowa whaani?<verse eid="JOB 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 9:25" />“Mazuwa ga heni ganguluta himahima kusinda yalingubilima lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:25">gangubilima ne heni kona ganojile kuli mazuwa ago.<verse eid="JOB 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 9:26" />Gangukola himahima kusinda itumbwi lya midete,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:26">kota ikungule lilingudulichila upelembi wake.<verse eid="JOB 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 9:27" />Wone ndonje, ‘Ndokusemwa kung'ung'uta kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">ndogalula kumeho kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:27">na kukudita kuwe na usangalalo,’<verse eid="JOB 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 9:28" />ila nding'hali ndangukudumba kugazika kweng'ha kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:28">kwa vila ndanguvizela kota Nguluwi hombona kota ndahela nongwa.<verse eid="JOB 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 9:29" />Kwa vila namboneka kota ndina nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:29">lekachoni lelo nditunye hihi hela?<verse eid="JOB 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 9:30" />Hanga nandihovuje kwa sabuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:30">na kugeliza moko ga heni,<verse eid="JOB 9:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 9:31" />heye yahanhozile kuli ikulubila liwele na nhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:31">mbaka mivalo ja heni jahanzudile ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 9:32" />“Nguluwi hawele munhu kota heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">ahyo siweza kumwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:32">siweza kitwanza naye kuli chitala.<verse eid="JOB 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 9:33" />Haduhu mhanyisi hali hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:33">yawele yahatwamule.<verse eid="JOB 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 9:34" />Yose ng'hobwa ayo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:34">leka kukabusa kwa heye kuleche kingalila lunhwinhwi!<verse eid="JOB 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 9:35" />Aho ndahalonjile ne kumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 9:35">ila vyoiwele sambi kwa heni, siweza.”<verse eid="JOB 9:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JOB 10" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangulonga kota kangukuzudila kikala kwa heye</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 10:1" />“Ndangukuzudila ng'hatu kikala kwa heni!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">Ndolonga hazelu kung'ung'uta kwa heni ne kilemeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:1">kwa kiwhana na usungu wa nhumbula ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 10:2" />Ndomlonjela Nguluwi, ‘Uleche kunhagusa kota ndina nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:2">ila nzelese, kuna ulonjelezi wachi kuwala heni?’<verse eid="JOB 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 10:3" />Ndaze, yangukunojeza hegwe kunzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">kubeza mijito ja moko ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:3">na kuganilila majesa gehile ga wehile?<verse eid="JOB 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 10:4" />Ndaze, kuna meho kota ga munhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:4">Ndaze, kwangulola kota munhu vyoyalingulola?<verse eid="JOB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 10:5" />Ndaze, mazuwa ga hegwe ndo kota ga munhu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:5">Ama miyaka ja hegwe ndo kota ja munhu,<verse eid="JOB 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 10:6" />mbaka ulole wihe wa heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:6">na kupala gehile ga heni?<verse eid="JOB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 10:7" />Hegwe kwanguvizela kota heni ndahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:7">haduhu yawele koweza kundavya kuli moko ga hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 10:8" />Moko ga hegwe nagandita na kulumba heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:8">ila sambi moko ago gangundumya.<verse eid="JOB 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 10:9" />Ukumbuchile kota nakulumba heni kwa ilongo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:9">Ndaze, konyhilusa kuli nhimbwisi kahi?<verse eid="JOB 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 10:10" />Ndaze, hauwele hegwe uwele nakulongoza kulumbigwa kwa heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:10">na kundita ndikule kuli munda wa mayangu?<verse eid="JOB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 10:11" />Nakulumba lukuli lwa heni kwa mizeje na mishipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:11">nakujigubika mizeje ja heni kwa miwunde na ngozi.<verse eid="JOB 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 10:12" />Nakumha heni ukomu na igano lya kwimilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:12">nakuwamila na kuulolela ukomu wa heni.<verse eid="JOB 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 10:13" />Ila mbuli azi nakuzivisa mnhumbula mwa hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:13">Ndanguvizela kota ako nakwali ndo kunuwila kwa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 10:14" />Nawali ubeteza leka wone kota ndodita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:14">leka uleme kulechela wihe wa heni.<verse eid="JOB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 10:15" />Ndochona heni wone ndina nongwa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">Wone ndo nhanganiche, siweza kidaya hebu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:15">kwa vila namema soni, londigalola magazo ga heni.<verse eid="JOB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 10:16" />Wone nyhinule mutwi kwangumhelemba kota isimba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:16">na kundajila vinduzanduza vya kungaza.<verse eid="JOB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 10:17" />Kwangigala walolezi wanyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">kwangonjeza ng'halazi ya hegwe kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:17">kwangungalila wang'honyo wanji wanhowe.<verse eid="JOB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 10:18" />“Gwa Nguluwi, lekachoni nakundavya mmunda mwa mayangu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:18">Fola ndahabagame ne wanhu kumbona.<verse eid="JOB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 10:19" />Ndahahilichigwe kutiligwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:19">ndahawele kota munhu yawele hanawahika kuwa baho.<verse eid="JOB 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 10:20" />Ndaze, mazuwa ga kikala kwa heni hagawele mado?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:20">Undeche leka mhate mhela udo wa kusangalala,<verse eid="JOB 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 10:21" />mbele nding'hali kuluta kuli honhu hawele siweza kuhiluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:21">kuli isi ya jiza totolo,<verse eid="JOB 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 10:22" />isi ya masinzo na iwele na ivuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 10:22">kuwele lumuli lwake ndo kota jiza.”<verse eid="JOB 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JOB 11" />
  <para style="s">Sofali kangwaluka kulongasa na Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 11:1" />Hamba Sofali, Mnaama, nakamwidichila Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 11:2" />“Ndaze, ulonzi awu weng'ha ukole hihi hela ne kwidichilwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:2">Ndaze, ayu yalingulonga lukami yatawizwe kota kana hachi?<verse eid="JOB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 11:3" />Ndaze, ulonzi wa hegwe wa chipoka uwadite wanhu wanyamalile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:3">Ndaze, munhu yaleche kukung'hanuchila hala houbeza?<verse eid="JOB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 11:4" />Kwangumlonjela Nguluwi, ‘Makundo ga heni ndo ga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:4">ndahela nongwa hali hegwe.’<verse eid="JOB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 11:5" />Wone Nguluwi yahalonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:5">yahagubule mlomo wa heye kukwidichila,<verse eid="JOB 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 11:6" />yahakulonjele kuwala uviso wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">kwa vila nakamema uwanzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:6">Uvizele kota Nguluwi hagawazile gehile ga hegwe geng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 11:7" />“Ndaze, koweza kuvizela uviso wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:7">na mbaka wa mong'ho wa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali?<verse eid="JOB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 11:8" />Ukulu wa heye naupuluta ulanga, hegwe kwanguweza choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">Wimo wa heye wangupuluta kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:8">hegwe kwanguweza kuvizela choni?<verse eid="JOB 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 11:9" />Ukulu awo wangupuluta ukulu wa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:9">na ugazi wa bahali.<verse eid="JOB 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 11:10" />Wone Nguluwi kokuya kwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">na kukutagusa na kukuwika mchinweng'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:10">whaani yoweza kumlemeza?<verse eid="JOB 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 11:11" />Nguluwi kanguwazela wanhu wohambe watanze chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:11">Ndaze, hoyogona gehile ga hewo kangugalekaga hela?<verse eid="JOB 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 11:12" />“Mpoka koweza kuwa na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:12">hala du lyana lya idogowi lya kisolo lyopondigwa liwele munhu.<verse eid="JOB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 11:13" />Ayubu, uleche gehile ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:13">winule moko ga hegwe kumlanda Nguluwi!<verse eid="JOB 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 11:14" />Wone kuna wihe, utaje kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:14">uleche kukunda uwe mng'handa mwa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 11:15" />Ahyo, wahawele ulihela soni hali wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:15">wahawele nzinzili ne kudumba.<verse eid="JOB 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 11:16" />Kogasemwa magazo ga hegwe geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:16">kota vila mazi tendema gawele nagapuluta.<verse eid="JOB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 11:17" />Kikala kwa hegwe kopulika kusinda isanya kuli mhela wa nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:17">jiza lyake lyogaluka na kuwa lumuli lwa kubwemwenzuka.<verse eid="JOB 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 11:18" />Kowa na kikala goya, kwa vila kitumbila kwa baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:18">kokwamilwa na kokwesela kwa kikala goya.<verse eid="JOB 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 11:19" />Kowasa ne kudumbizwa na munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:19">wanhu wenji wokulanda utanzi.<verse eid="JOB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 11:20" />Ila meho ga wehile gobilabila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">nzila za hewo zeng'ha za kubilimila zokwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 11:20">kitumbila kwa hewo kwa kuduma kowa ndo kubagama!”<verse eid="JOB 11:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JOB 12" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Sofali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 12:1" />Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 12:2" />“Goya! Hemwe mwa wanhu muwele na nyhala lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:2">hemwe lombagama na luhala lweng'ha lobagama.<verse eid="JOB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 12:3" />Nani ndina kuvizela kota hemwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">Siwele na nyhala ndodo kusinda hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:3">geng'ha gomlonjile chila munhu kangugazela.<verse eid="JOB 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 12:4" />Goloko wa heni wanguseka heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">hanga nandimchema Nguluwi naye nakanyidichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">Nandiwa munhu wa kusechigwa hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:4">hanga nda nhanganiche na ndilihela nongwa!<verse eid="JOB 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 12:5" />Munhu yohambe yafichigwe na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">kanguwasekaga wala wawele nawafichigwa na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:5">kangijesaga kota magazo ganguwafikaga wala walingutelela.<verse eid="JOB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 12:6" />Mihema ja wabokaji jina kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">walingumzudiza Nguluwi wangikala kwa kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:6">mong'ho wa hewo ndo mlungu wawo.<verse eid="JOB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 12:7" />“Jiuze migongolo najo jokulangusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:7">ama videje navyo vyokulonjela.<verse eid="JOB 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 12:8" />Jiuze kahi misolo najo jokulangusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:8">ama somba nazo zokulonjela.<verse eid="JOB 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 12:9" />Chilumbigwe chachi hali avyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:9">chiwele hachizelele kota Mkulu Nguluwi nakavilumba avyo?<verse eid="JOB 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 12:10" />Ukomu wa chila chilumbigwe chilingikala wa kuli moko ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:10">hihyo du na muhe wa ukomu wa munhu.<verse eid="JOB 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 12:11" />Ndaze, ikutu hambe lipime ulonzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:11">kota umyango vyoulingujeza chilyo?<verse eid="JOB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 12:12" />Ndaze, luhala haluwele kwa wasekulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:12">na uwanzi kwa hewo wekale mhela winji?<verse eid="JOB 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 12:13" />Ila luhala na ludali ndo vya heye Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:13">kana uwanzi na kuvizela.<verse eid="JOB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 12:14" />Hoyobomola, haduhu yoweza kuzenga kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:14">hoyomhindila munhu mchinweng'ho, haduhu yoweza kumtanza kusulupuka.<verse eid="JOB 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 12:15" />Hoyolemeza nhonya isi yanguwa kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:15">hoyoilechela, isi yangufichigwa na mazi tendema.<verse eid="JOB 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 12:16" />Heye kana ludali na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:16">walinguhadigwa na walinguhada ndo wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 12:17" />Kanguholaga luhala lwa vilongozi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:17">na kuwadita wawe kota wapoka.<verse eid="JOB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 12:18" />Kanguwosaga wandewa kofia za hewo za chiundewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:18">na kuwawoha mchuno ng'weso za mchinweng'ho.<verse eid="JOB 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 12:19" />Kanguholaga mivalo ja chiutambika kulawa kwa watambika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:19">na ludali lwa wala walinguwalongoza wanhu wanji.<verse eid="JOB 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 12:20" />Kanguwadita walingukundigwa wanyamalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:20">na kuwasukula wasekulu luhala lwa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 12:21" />Kanguwabasaga soni wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:21">kanguwoselaga mong'ho wawele na ludali.<verse eid="JOB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 12:22" />Kangugubulaga mbuli ziwele kuli jiza totolo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:22">na kigala kuli lumuli gala gawele kuli uviso.<verse eid="JOB 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 12:23" />Kanguwenulaga wanhu wa isi, hamba kanguwadumyaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:23">kanguwaditaga wawe wenji hamba kanguwasambalulaga.<verse eid="JOB 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 12:24" />Kanguwoselaga vilongozi wa wanhu uwanzi wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:24">kanguwaditaga walubelube kuchiwala kulihela nzila.<verse eid="JOB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 12:25" />Nawo wangukwabasaga kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 12:25">na kuwadita wazebeduche kota nawagala.<verse eid="JOB 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JOB 13" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangulutilila kwidichila</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 13:1" />“Ago geng'ha nandigona kwa meho ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:1">nandigahulika kwa makutu ga heni na kugazela.<verse eid="JOB 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 13:2" />Geng'ha gomgazelele, nani ndangugazela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:2">siwele na nyhala ndodo kusinda hemwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 13:3" />Ndina maya ng'hatu ga kulongasa na Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:3">ndangugana kilewela hali Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 13:4" />Ila hemwe mwangulonga udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:4">mweng'ha ndo kota wateleka mikwandi wohambe mtanze chinhu.<verse eid="JOB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 13:5" />Fola mwahanyamalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:5">alyo lyahawele ndo luhala kwa hemwe!<verse eid="JOB 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 13:6" />Mhulichize lelo ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:6">mnyhulichize hondichilewela.<verse eid="JOB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 13:7" />Ndaze, mwangijesa kota mwangumkolela mijito Nguluwi kwa kulonga udesi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:7">Mwangijesa kota uhadi wangumnojeza heye?<verse eid="JOB 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 13:8" />Ndaze, mwangujeza kumganilila Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:8">Ndaze, momlewela Nguluwi hoyowa kuli chitala?<verse eid="JOB 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 13:9" />Ndaze, wone kowapugajiza hemwe, hamfichigwa na nongwa yoneche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:9">Ama mwangijesa kota moweza kumhada Nguluwi kota vyomlingudita kwa wanhu?<verse eid="JOB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 13:10" />Ndangukomya, kowang'hanuchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:10">wone molajila uganililo kwa uviso.<verse eid="JOB 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 13:11" />Ndaze, ukulu wa heye haulinguwakabusa hemwe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:11">Ndaze, hamlingudumba kwa chiwalo cha heye?<verse eid="JOB 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 13:12" />Ulonzi wa hemwe haulingutanza chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:12">kilewela kwa hemwe ndo kota ngome za misanga.<verse eid="JOB 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 13:13" />“Mnyamalile, leka nani ndonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:13">gawele gofika kwa heni, leka gafiche.<verse eid="JOB 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 13:14" />Nda goya kwimilila chinhu choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:14">mbaka kubagama.<verse eid="JOB 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 13:15" />Hanga kong'hopola ila nding'hali ndangitumbila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:15">ndikomya, ndochilewela hali heye.<verse eid="JOB 13:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 13:16" />Ena, ali lyowa ulohozi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">kwa vila haduhu munhu yohambe yamdumbe Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:16">yawele koweza kuluta hali heye!<verse eid="JOB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 13:17" />Mhulichize goya ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:17">nago makutu ga hemwe gabochele chila chondilingulonga.<verse eid="JOB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 13:18" />Lelo nda goya kilewela kuli chitala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:18">ndangukomya, ndahela nongwa.<verse eid="JOB 13:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 13:19" />Ndaze, hana yoneche yalinguweza kigala ulonjelezi kuwala heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:19">Wone yowa ahyo, ndonyamalila leka mbagame.<verse eid="JOB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 13:20" />“Gwa, Nguluwi wa heni, ndangukulanda mbuli azi mbili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:20">nani sivisa hali hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 13:21" />Wuse tandi moko wa hegwe ulingunhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:21">na uleche kung'habusa.<verse eid="JOB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 13:22" />Waluche kulonga nani ndokwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:22">ama heni nyaluche nagwe widichile.<verse eid="JOB 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 13:23" />Nandita gehile galinga na nongwa zilinga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:23">Nzelese nongwa na gehile ga heni.<verse eid="JOB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 13:24" />Lekachoni hulingugana kungalamchila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:24">Lekachoni kwangunditila kota mng'honyo wa hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 13:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 13:25" />Lekachoni kwangung'habusa heni ihamba likalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:25">na kumbilimisa heni kota mhumba ilinguwembeluswa na mbeho?<verse eid="JOB 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 13:26" />Nakulavya ulonjelezi ung'ang'ale kuwala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:26">na kundita ndipiche gehile ga usongolo wa heni.<verse eid="JOB 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 13:27" />Kwanguwoha magulu ga heni kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">kwangukulolela kujenda kwa heni kweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:27">nzayo za heni nakuziwichila kuduma.<verse eid="JOB 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 13:28" />Nani ndangumala kota igodi lyolile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 13:28">kota ivalo lidakuligwe na fukuzi.”<verse eid="JOB 13:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JOB 14" />
  <para style="s">Kikala kuna masinzo na kubagama kwa habehi</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 14:1" />“Munhu yawele nakapondigwa na mdala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:1">mazuwa ga heye ga kikala ndo mado hela nago nagamema magazo.<verse eid="JOB 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 14:2" />Kangubahulaga kota uluwa hamba kanguswinaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:2">kangwajililaga hima hima kota isisila.<verse eid="JOB 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 14:3" />Gwa Nguluwi, lekachoni kwangijesa kundola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:3">na kwaluka kunhagusa?<verse eid="JOB 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 14:4" />Whaani yalinguweza kulavya chinhu chelile kulawa kuli chinhu chikokomoche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:4">Haduhu yawele koweza.<verse eid="JOB 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 14:5" />Mazuwa ga kikala kwa munhu gana kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">gwa, Nguluwi nakujiwaza myezi jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:5">halinguweza kikala mzidi wa aho.<verse eid="JOB 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 14:6" />Ahyo umleche leka yasangalale kuli mazuwa ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:6">kota yalingupegwa mijito chila zuwa.<verse eid="JOB 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 14:7" />Kwa baho kitumbila kuli igodi liwele nalitemigwa, kota lyokota,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:7">na mizuchila jake jinyale jolutilila kukula.<verse eid="JOB 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 14:8" />Hanga mizabi jake jolala kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:8">chibichi chake chokwajilila kuli misanga,<verse eid="JOB 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 14:9" />ila wone hawe na ulajilo wa mazi lyozuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:9">lyolavya mizuchila kota igodi lilingwaluka kukula.<verse eid="JOB 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 14:10" />Ila munhu kangubagamaga na ako ndo kuduma kwa heye.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:10">Wone muhe ulawe kwa heye, kana choni kahi?<verse eid="JOB 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 14:11" />Kota vila mazi vyogalingukala kuli ilamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:11">na mazi kuleka kuchililika kuli lwanda,<verse eid="JOB 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 14:12" />ndo vyoyalingubagama munhu, halingulilimka kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">mbaka ulanga houwa haduhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">hokwinuka kahi ne kutinhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:12">haduhu munhu yawele koweza kumwinula.<verse eid="JOB 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 14:13" />“Fola wahavisile heni kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">mbaka ng'halazi ya hegwe ihole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:13">hamba, kuli mhela wa hegwe wahang'humbuchile.<verse eid="JOB 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 14:14" />Ndaze, wone munhu yabagame koweza kikala kahi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">Wone ndo ahyo, ndahawele na kitumbila kuli kikala kwa heni kweng'ha kwa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:14">na ndahabeteze kwa maya ng'hatu kuloholigwa kulawa kuli kubagama.<verse eid="JOB 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 14:15" />Aho wahanyemile, nani ndahakwidichidile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:15">nagwe wahanojezwe na heni chilumbigwe cha hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 14:16" />Ndikomya, wahaziwinzile nzayo za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:16">ila haiwele kugalola gehile ga heni.<verse eid="JOB 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 14:17" />Nongwa za heni wahazihindile kuli chihako,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:17">nagwe wahaugubiche wihe wa heni.<verse eid="JOB 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 14:18" />“Kota vidunda vyovilingugwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:18">na mitalawe vyojilingulawa kuli honhu hake,<verse eid="JOB 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 14:19" />kota mazi vyogalingudita maganga gamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">mazi tendema vyogalinguhola misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:19">ndo nagwe vyoulinguwifya kitumbila kwa wanhu.<verse eid="JOB 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 14:20" />Kwangumgwisa munhu, naye kangwajililaga mazuwa gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:20">Kwangukugalula kumeho kwa heye na kumtajila kutali.<verse eid="JOB 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 14:21" />Wone wana wa heye wapegwe lutogo, halinguvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:21">wone wobezigwa, halingulola.<verse eid="JOB 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 14:22" />Kanguwaga na usungu wa lukuli lwa heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 14:22">na kangulombochezaga kwa chiwalo cha heye yuye hela.”<verse eid="JOB 14:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JOB 15" />
  <para style="s">Elifasi kangulonga lwa keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 15:1" />Hamba Elifasi, Mtemani, nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 15:2" />“Ndaze, munhu yawele na luhala kangwidichilaga kwa ulonzi wa chipoka?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:2">Kwangulonga ulonzi wa hihi hela.<verse eid="JOB 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 15:3" />Ndaze, munhu yawele na luhala kangilewelaga kwa ulonzi wihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:3">ama kwa ulonzi wohambe utanze chinhu?<verse eid="JOB 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 15:4" />Ila kwa ulonzi wa hegwe, kwangulajila kota kwangukubeza kumdumba Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:4">kwanguwalemeza wanhu kijesa kuwala Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 15:5" />Nongwa za hegwe ndo zilinguulongoza mlomo wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:5">nagwe kwanguhagula kulonga kota wahadi.<verse eid="JOB 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 15:6" />Siwele heni, ila ulonzi wa gwegwe baho ndo wangukutagusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:6">choulingulonga ndo chilingukulonjeleza.<verse eid="JOB 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 15:7" />Ndaze, hegwe ndo munhu wa mwaluko kupondigwa?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:7">Ndaze, nakupondigwa kung'hali kuwa na vidunda?<verse eid="JOB 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 15:8" />Ndaze, hegwe nakuhulika mbuli za chitala cha Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:8">ama, hegwe uliyeng'ha ndo uwele na luhala?<verse eid="JOB 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 15:9" />Kwanguchizela chinhu chachi chiwele hatuchizelele?<verse eid="JOB 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 15:10" />Hali hetwe wabaho wasekulu wawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:10">wawele na miyaka minji kusinda mhaza wa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 15:11" />Ndaze, uhembulizo woyalingukupa Nguluwi haulinguhega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:11">ama, ulonzi wa heye wa uliholile haulingutanza chinhu kwa hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 15:12" />Lekachoni nhumbula ya hegwe yangukwambuza uzudile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:12">na kukudita unogole meho,<verse eid="JOB 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 15:13" />mbaka kwangumbelenhuka Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:13">na kulonga ulonzi wihile kota awo?<verse eid="JOB 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 15:14" />“Munhu ndo chinhu chachi mbaka yawe yalihela gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:14">ama yula yapondigwe na mdala mbaka yawe yatanganiche?<verse eid="JOB 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 15:15" />Wone Nguluwi halinguwakunda mbaka wahilisi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:15">na ulanga hawenele kumeho kwa heye,<verse eid="JOB 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 15:16" />yowa mzidi kwa mwihe na yajilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:16">munhu yalingudita wihe kota vila kunwa mazi!<verse eid="JOB 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 15:17" />“Lelo unyhulichize, nani ndokulonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:17">ndokulajila gala gondigawene,<verse eid="JOB 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 15:18" />mbuli za wawele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:18">ziwele wasekulu wa hewo hawazivisile,<verse eid="JOB 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 15:19" />wawele hewo waliyeka, Nguluwi nakawapa isi ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:19">haduhu mjenzi yawele nakakola hali hewo.<verse eid="JOB 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 15:20" />Mwihe kogazika kwa usungu kuli mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:20">miyaka jeng'ha joyawichilwe yula yalingubunza.<verse eid="JOB 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 15:21" />Lizi lya kukabusa lyotowa iyowe kuli makutu ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:21">hoyochijesa kota kangulutilila goya, yalingudumya komvaba.<verse eid="JOB 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 15:22" />Mwihe kahela kitumbila kulawa kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:22">kuduma kwa heye ndo kubagama kwa ipanga.<verse eid="JOB 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 15:23" />Ikungule lyanguzunguluta mchanya mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:23">kanguvizela kota zuwa lya jiza lyangumhejelela.<verse eid="JOB 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 15:24" />Magazo na usungu vyangumkabusa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:24">vyangumfika kota chilundo cha wamizi wa mndewa walingutowa.<verse eid="JOB 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 15:25" />Kwa vila nakagolola moko wa heye kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:25">nakajeza kumtowa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,<verse eid="JOB 15:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 15:26" />kwa ujuvi nakabilima kuluta kumtowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:26">kuno yawele na ngawo ng'hulu na iwele nzinzili.<verse eid="JOB 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 15:27" />Kumeho kwa heye nakuneneha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:27">na chuno cha heye nachimema mafuta.<verse eid="JOB 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 15:28" />Nakekala kuli miji jilechigwe ne chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">kuli ng'handa zilihela wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:28">ng'handa ziwele naziwifigwa.<verse eid="JOB 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 15:29" />Howeza kuwa na lufufu kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">lufufu lwa heye haluweza kulutilila kwa mhela winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:29">na ng'hano za heye haziwa nyinji muisi.<verse eid="JOB 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 15:30" />Howeza kiwika kutali na jiza.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">Kowa kota igodi liwele mizuchila jake najilakazwa kwa chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:30">uluwa wake nauwembeluswa na mbeho.<verse eid="JOB 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 15:31" />Fola yaleche kitumbila upoka na kihada,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:31">kwa vila upoka wowa ndo chonolo cha heye.<verse eid="JOB 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 15:32" />Kolipigwa geng'ha hoyowa yang'hali kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:32">nazo nhagala zake hazilutilila goya.<verse eid="JOB 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 15:33" />Kowa kota mzabibu ulingulagaza zabibu ndodi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:33">kota mzeituni ulingulagaza uluwa wake.<verse eid="JOB 15:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 15:34" />Weng'ha wohambe wamdumbe Nguluwi hawopata wana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:34">chiluli chojilakaza mihema ja wala walingupegwa chinhu kwa chiwalo cha kwajiliza hachi.<verse eid="JOB 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 15:35" />Wangijesa uhadi na kulela wihe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 15:35">Nhumbula zawo zangijesa kuwala uhadi.”<verse eid="JOB 15:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JOB 16" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangutawiza kahi kota kahela nongwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 16:1" />Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 16:2" />“Kwa vila nanyhulika mbuli nyinji kota azo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:2">hemwe mwanguhembuliza heni kwa kungaza!<verse eid="JOB 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 16:3" />Ndaze, winji wa ulonzi wa hemwe wohambe utanze chinhu wahela kuduma?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:3">Mna choni hemwe mbaka mlutilile kitwanza kwa ulonzi?<verse eid="JOB 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 16:4" />Heni ndahawezile kulonga kota hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">wone mwahawele kota vyombele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">ndahawezile kudamla goya hali hemwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:4">na kulonga ulonzi wa kubeza kwa hemwe.<verse eid="JOB 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 16:5" />Ndahawezile kuwakangaza nhumbula kwa ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:5">ulonzi wa heni wa kuhembuliza wahawaditile hemwe msindamale.<verse eid="JOB 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 16:6" />“Wone ndonje, usungu wa heni haulingusindamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:6">wone nyhamalile, haulinguka.<verse eid="JOB 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 16:7" />Ndikomya, Nguluwi nakambifya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:7">nakalidumya ivyazi lya heni lyeng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 16:8" />Nakandita swinhe, awo ndo ulolezi kota nandita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:8">wanhu wangijesa kota kuganda kwa heni kwangwambuzwa na nongwa ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 16:9" />Nguluwi nakanhowa na kundumiza kwa ng'halazi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">kangujejeda mizino ja heye kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:9">mng'honyo wa heni kangundola kwa kuzudila ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 16:10" />Wanhu wangumbeza heni na kuseka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">vilundo kwa vilundo wangunzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:10">wangunzabula mizeze.<verse eid="JOB 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 16:11" />Nguluwi nakambika mmoko mwa wajuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:11">na kunhoza mmoko mwa wehile.<verse eid="JOB 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 16:12" />Mbuli zeng'ha nazali goya, ila nakambenanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">nakandinya singo na kumhonda.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:12">Nakandita ndiwe honhu ha kutowa misale ja heye,<verse eid="JOB 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 16:13" />watoza misale wa heye wangunzunguluta heni.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">Ne isungu, wanguhoma figo za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:13">na kubohola nhungwi ya heni mchanya mwa isi.<verse eid="JOB 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 16:14" />Kangumbenaga na kunhowa chila mhela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:14">kangunhowaga kota vyoyalingudita yazidahe kitowa ngondo.<verse eid="JOB 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 16:15" />“Nandihonela ivalo lya igunila hali lukuli lwa heni kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:15">ndangikala kuli nhimbwisi kota munhu yawele nakasumigwa ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 16:16" />Kumeho kwa heni nakuwa kudung'hu kwa kulila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:16">meho ga heni gana jiza ng'hatu,<verse eid="JOB 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 16:17" />ila moko ga heni hagaditile ujuvi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:17">na kulanda kwa heni kwa goya.<verse eid="JOB 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 16:18" />“Gwa isi, uleche kuigubika danda ya heni iwele naibohoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:18">kulila kwa heni kwenele chila honhu.<verse eid="JOB 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 16:19" />Ndikomya, ndina mlolezi kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:19">wa kundewela ka kuchanya.<verse eid="JOB 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 16:20" />Goloko wa heni wangumbeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:20">ndangulavya mahozi kumlanda Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 16:21" />Fola munhu yahandewele hali Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:21">kota munhu vyoyalingumlewela goloko wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 16:22" />Ena, miyaka ja heni ndo michefu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 16:22">nani ndoluta ako kuwele siweza kuhiluka.”<verse eid="JOB 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JOB 17" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangulutilila kulonga na kangwajiliza kitumbila</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 17:1" />“Nhumbula ya heni naitweguka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">mazuwa ga heni nagamala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:1">chilaga changumbeteza.<verse eid="JOB 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 17:2" />Ndikomya walingubeza nawanzunguluta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:2">meho ga heni ganguwona ung'honyo wa hewo hela.<verse eid="JOB 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 17:3" />“Gwa Nguluwi, wiwiche lehani kwa chiwalo cha heni kwa gwegwe baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:3">kwa vila haduhu yunji wa kudita ahyo kwa chiwalo cha heni.<verse eid="JOB 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 17:4" />Nakudinya luhala lwawo luleche kuwa na kuvizela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:4">ahyo uleche kukunda wasumye heni.<verse eid="JOB 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 17:5" />Munhu yalingumbelenhuka goloko wa heye leka yapate chinhu cha mzidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:5">wana wa heye wogazika.<verse eid="JOB 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 17:6" />“Nguluwi nakandita nzomelwe na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:6">na kutemelwa mite.<verse eid="JOB 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 17:7" />Meho ga heni nagabilabila kwa masinzo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:7">lukuli lwa heni lweng'ha naluwa kota isisila.<verse eid="JOB 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 17:8" />Wagoloche wangububuwala howombona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:8">na walihela ngongwa wangundonjeleza kota silingumdumba Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 17:9" />Ila yatanganiche kobatilila nzila za heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:9">munhu yalingudita ganojile kangulutililaga kuwa na mong'ho ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 17:10" />Ila hemwe muye, muye mweng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:10">kwa hemwe siweza kumpata yawele na luhala, ne yumwe.<verse eid="JOB 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 17:11" />Mazuwa ga heni nagamala, kiwika goya kwa heni nakubenigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:11">kitumbila kwa nhumbula ya heni nakwajilila.<verse eid="JOB 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 17:12" />Wanhu awa wanguiditaga nechilo kuwa nemisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:12">kuwele na jiza, hewo wangulongaga, ‘Lumuli lwa habehi.’<verse eid="JOB 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 17:13" />Wone kuli isi ya wabagame ndo ng'handa ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:13">kikala kwa heni kwa amo kuli jiza,<verse eid="JOB 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 17:14" />wone ndokulonjela kuwifya, ‘Hegwe ndo mhaza wa heni,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:14">na kuilonjela mhiko, ‘Hegwe ndo mamo wa heni’ ama ‘Lumbu lyangu,’<verse eid="JOB 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 17:15" />kwa kohi lelo kitumbila kwa heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:15">Whaani yoweza kukona kitumbila koneche kwa chiwalo cha heni?<verse eid="JOB 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 17:16" />Kitumbila kwa heni kodulika na heni kuli isi ya wabagame!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 17:16">Weng'ha weli todulika mbaka ako kuli nhimbwisi!”<verse eid="JOB 17:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JOB 18" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kangulonga lwa keli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 18:1" />Bilidadi, Mshuhi, nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 18:2" />“Kopelemba ulonzi wa kulonga mbaka nili?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:2">Uwe na luhala natwe tolonga.<verse eid="JOB 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 18:3" />Lekachoni hetwe twangujesigwa kota migongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:3">na koneka wapoka hali meho ga hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 18:4" />Hegwe ulingidadula kwa ng'halazi ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">ndaze, kwangijesa kota kwa kudita ahyo koweza kuitigasa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:4">ama kujidita mitalawe jilawe kuli honhu hake?<verse eid="JOB 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 18:5" />“Kikala kwa mwihe kowa kota chenje chizimigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:5">nalyo ilapi lya chiluli chake halipulika.<verse eid="JOB 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 18:6" />Lumuli kuli ihema lya heye naluwa jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:6">chenje chiwele habehi na heye nachizimigwa.<verse eid="JOB 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 18:7" />Mong'ho wa heye wa kujenda wokusigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:7">majesa gehile ga heye gomgwisa heye yuye.<verse eid="JOB 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 18:8" />Magulu ga heye gangumgwiliza kuli utandawala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:8">kangugwila kuli ikulubila.<verse eid="JOB 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 18:9" />Idiwa lyomgwiliza kuli chisigino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:9">ng'weso zomibatilila ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 18:10" />Ng'weso naivisigwa kuli misanga kwa chiwalo cha heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:10">idiwa lya kuli nzila ya heye.<verse eid="JOB 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 18:11" />Ukabuso wangumdita yawe na lunhwinhwi chila ubanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:11">wangumuwinza chila hoyojenda.<verse eid="JOB 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 18:12" />Nayali na mong'ho ila lelo nzala naimibata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:12">magazo gangugana kumgwisa.<verse eid="JOB 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 18:13" />Utamwa wangulya ngozi ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:13">na kwambuza kola vitomo vya lukuli lwa heye.<verse eid="JOB 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 18:14" />Kokusigwa kulawa kuli ng'handa iwele nayali yochitumbila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:14">na kuhilichigwa kwa mndewa wa ukabuso.<verse eid="JOB 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 18:15" />Ng'handa ya heye yahela munhu, wanji wochikala amo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:15">chiluli cha chikwatilo chowichigwa mchanya mwa honhu hake ha kikala.<verse eid="JOB 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 18:16" />Kowa kota igodi, liwele mizabi jake najikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:16">nhagala zake naziswinha.<verse eid="JOB 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 18:17" />Kukumbuchilwa kwa heye kuli isi kokwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:17">haduhu yawele koweza kumkumbuchila.<verse eid="JOB 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 18:18" />Nakosigwa kuli lumuli na kutajigwa kuli jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:18">nakawinjigwa yalawe muisi.<verse eid="JOB 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 18:19" />Kahela wana ne wazukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:19">haduhuli yasigale kuli haluga hake.<verse eid="JOB 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 18:20" />Wanhu wa kolizinjilaga isanya nawabubuwazwa kwa gala gamfichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:20">lunhwinhwi naluwafika wanhu wa kolilawilaga isanya.<verse eid="JOB 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 18:21" />Ago ndo galinguwafika wala wohambe wamdumbe Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 18:21">aho ndo honhu ha wehile, wohambe wamzele Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JOB 18:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JOB 19" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila kahi Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 19:1" />Aho Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 19:2" />“Ndaze, molutilila kungaza mbaka nili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:2">na kumbenanga heni kwa ulonzi wa hemwe?<verse eid="JOB 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 19:3" />Mala ya kumi ayi mwangundonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:3">ne soni mwangunhowa.<verse eid="JOB 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 19:4" />Hanga ndahawele nyhajilile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:4">nongwa ya heni yosigala kwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 19:5" />Mwangijesa kota mwa wanojile kusinda heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:5">mwangugona magazo ga heni kota gangutawiza nongwa za heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 19:6" />Mvizele kota Nguluwi nakanditila vibi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:6">nakangwiliza kuli utandawala wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 19:7" />Ulole ndangutowa iyowe, ‘Kubunza!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">Ila haduhu wa kwidichila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">Ndanguchema kwa lizi likulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:7">ila silingupata hachi ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 19:8" />Nakaidinya nzila ya heni kwa lukanzi, leka ndeche kukola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:8">nakawika jiza kuli nzila ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 19:9" />Nakawusa ukulu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:9">na kusa lutogo lwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 19:10" />Nakawifya chila honhu ha lukuli lwa heni, mbaka nda habehi kumala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:10">nakang'humbula kitumbila kwa heni kota igodi.<verse eid="JOB 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 19:11" />Ng'halazi ya heye nayaka kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:11">nakambona kota nda yumwe hali wang'honyo wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 19:12" />Wamizi wa heye wanguya kwa mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">nawagongomanya nzila ya kuya kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:12">nawawika kambi kuizunguluta ng'handa ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 19:13" />Nguluwi nakawawika kalumbu wa heni kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:13">na kwambuza goloko wa heni kunditila kota mjenzi.<verse eid="JOB 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 19:14" />Wang'holozangu nawaluta kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:14">goloko wa heni nawasemwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 19:15" />Wajenzi wa kuli ng'handa ya heni nawasemwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">vitumagwa wa heni wadala wangumbona kota nda mjenzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:15">Kwa hewo, nandiwa munhu yohambe wamzele.<verse eid="JOB 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 19:16" />Ndangumchema chitumagwa wa heni ila halingwidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:16">hanga ndangumdedeza ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 19:17" />Nandiwa wavu kwa mche wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:17">na izudizo kwa wang'holozangu.<verse eid="JOB 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 19:18" />Mbaka wana wadodo wangumbezaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:18">hondichilajila wangunzomelaga.<verse eid="JOB 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 19:19" />Goloko wakulu wa heni wangunzudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:19">wala wondiwaganile nawandajila chigosi.<verse eid="JOB 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 19:20" />Lukuli lwa heni nalumala, mizeje na ngozi hela ndo visigale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:20">namhonela hado hela hala honyajilize geng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 19:21" />Mmbonele isungu hemwe goloko wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:21">kwa vila moko wa Nguluwi naunhowa.<verse eid="JOB 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 19:22" />Lekachoni mwangumbinza kota Nguluwi vyoyalingudita?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:22">Lekachoni mwangulutilila kungaza?<verse eid="JOB 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 19:23" />“Wone ulonzi wa heni wahandichigwe kuli kukumbuchila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:23">wahandichigwe kuli chitabu,<verse eid="JOB 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 19:24" />hanji wahacholigwe kwa chuma</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:24">mchanya mwa italawe wahasigale mazuwa gose!<verse eid="JOB 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 19:25" />Ndanguvizela kota mgombozi wa heni kangikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:25">naye komha heni hachi baha muisi.<verse eid="JOB 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 19:26" />Nding'hali mbele na lukuli lulu luwifigwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:26">ndomona Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 19:27" />Nene baha ndoting'hana naye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">nene baha, hawele yunji, ndomona.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:27">Lole ndaze nhumbula ya heni vyoiwele na maya ng'hatu kwa heye!<verse eid="JOB 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 19:28" />“Moweza kilonjela, ‘Lole vyotulingumpelemba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:28">kwa vila izabi lya nongwa lya mgati mwa heye,’<verse eid="JOB 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 19:29" />mwemwe baho mlidumbe ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">kwa vila ng'halazi yochigala kutowigwa kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 19:29">lelo movizela kota hana utaguso.”<verse eid="JOB 19:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JOB 20" />
  <para style="s">Sofali kangulonga kahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 20:1" />Hamba Sofali, Mnaama, nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 20:2" />“Majesa ga heni gangundita ndikwidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:2">siweza kilemeza kahi.<verse eid="JOB 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 20:3" />Nanyhulika ulonzi wa hegwe ulingundiga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:3">ila muhe wa heni wangundongoza kukwidichila.<verse eid="JOB 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 20:4" />“Ndikomya nakuisemwa mbuli ayi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:4">kota kulawa katali Nguluwi loyamlumbile munhu muisi,<verse eid="JOB 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 20:5" />mwihe kosechelela kusumya kwa heye kwa mhela uchefu hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:5">na kusangalala kwa yula yohambe yamdumbe Nguluwi, hakulingikala mazuwa menji!<verse eid="JOB 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 20:6" />Hanga kidaya kwa heye kwangufikaga kilanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:6">na mutwi wa heye wangudolizaga ng'hungugu,<verse eid="JOB 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 20:7" />lukuli lwa heye logaluka kuwa misanga kota midohe ja heye yuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:7">wala wawele nawali womzela wouza, ‘Ka kohi?’<verse eid="JOB 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 20:8" />Kokwajilila kota kulota, yaleche koneka kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:8">yaleche koneka kahi kota kulota kwa nechilo.<verse eid="JOB 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 20:9" />Yawele nakamona, homona kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:9">haluga ha heye hakuweza kumkumbuchila kahi.<verse eid="JOB 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 20:10" />Wana wa heye woganigwa kuhilusa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:10">vinhu viwele mhaza wa hewo nayali yaholile kulawa kwa wazunwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 20:11" />Hanga nayali yochiwona kota nakamema mong'ho wa usongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:11">kowasa na mong'ho awo kuli nhimbwisi.<verse eid="JOB 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 20:12" />“Kuli mlomo wa mwihe, wihe unoga kota sukali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:12">kanguuvisa hasi ha umyango wa heye,<verse eid="JOB 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 20:13" />halingukunda kuulechela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:13">ila kanguuwikaga kuli mlomo wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 20:14" />Houfika mmunda mwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:14">wanguwa dunga ing'ang'ale ya izoka mgati mwa heye.<verse eid="JOB 20:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 20:15" />Mwihe kangumelaga lufufu lwa kubunza na kuludeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:15">Nguluwi kangululavyaga kulawa mmunda mwa heye.<verse eid="JOB 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 20:16" />Kofyoma dunga ya izoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:16">kobagama kwa kulumwa na izoka.<verse eid="JOB 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 20:17" />Howeza kusangalala kwa chiwalo cha utambichizo kulawa kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">kota vikolola vya mafuta ga mzeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:17">ama nzanda zilingulavya hanombwa na itombo.<verse eid="JOB 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 20:18" />Mafuza ga chituguti cha heye kogalechelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:18">howeza kugajeza,<verse eid="JOB 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 20:19" />kwa vila nakawadumya wazunwa na kuwaleka ne chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:19">nakasukula ng'handa zohazenjile.<verse eid="JOB 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 20:20" />“Kwa vila maya ga heye gahela kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:20">howeza kulohola choneche choyalinguchigana.<verse eid="JOB 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 20:21" />Nakalya chila chinhu ne kuleka choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:21">ahyo kulutilila goya kwa heye hakuweza kikala kwa mhela winji.<verse eid="JOB 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 20:22" />Hagati ha kulutilila goya kwa heye, nongwa yomfika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:22">magazo gomfika kwa mong'ho weng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 20:23" />Hoyowa yamemeze lida lya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">Nguluwi kolajila kuzudila kwa heye kung'hang'hale</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:23">na kumhilichila magazo.<verse eid="JOB 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 20:24" />Hanga kochibilima chinhu cha kitowela ngondo cha chuma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:24">ila msale wa shaba womhoma.<verse eid="JOB 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 20:25" />Msale womhoma kuli lukuli lwake na kulawila ubanzi wa keli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">kunoleche kwake kolavigwa kumgongo kwake kuno kupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:25">ukabuso wa kubagama womvaba.<verse eid="JOB 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 20:26" />Ng'hano za heye zowifigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">chiluli cha kububuwaza chomlakaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:26">chinhu choneche chiwele chosigala mgati mwa ng'handa ya heye chodumigwa.<verse eid="JOB 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 20:27" />Ulanga wowika hazelu nongwa ya heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:27">isi yomlonjeleza.<verse eid="JOB 20:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 20:28" />Lufufu lwake loholigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:28">kuli zuwa lya kuzudila kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 20:29" />Acho ndo choyalingupegwa mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 20:29">chinhu chiwele Nguluwi nakamuwichila.”<verse eid="JOB 20:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JOB 21" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Sofali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 21:1" />Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 21:2" />“Mhulichize goya ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:2">aku ndo kuhembuliza kondilingukugana kulawa kwa hemwe.<verse eid="JOB 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 21:3" />Mndeche ndonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:3">hondisinda kulonga, mlutilile kumbeza.<verse eid="JOB 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 21:4" />Ndangumng'ung'utila Nguluwi haiwele munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:4">ahyo, lekachoni mbeteze?<verse eid="JOB 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 21:5" />Mndole, namwe mbubuwale kwa kumbona vyondilingutamika lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:5">mdinye milomo ja hemwe kwa moko ga hemwe.<verse eid="JOB 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 21:6" />Hondijesa kuwala mbuli ayi, ndangudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:6">lukuli lwa heni lwangukakama.<verse eid="JOB 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 21:7" />Lekachoni wehile wangulutilila kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">na mbuli za hewo zangulutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:7">na hawalingubagama mbaka howowa wasekulu ng'hatu?<verse eid="JOB 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 21:8" />Wanguwonaga wana wawo wolutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:8">na wazukulu wawo hali meho ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 21:9" />Ng'handa za hewo zangulutilila goya haduhu lunhwinhwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:9">na ng'hobwa ya Nguluwi hailinguwafika.<verse eid="JOB 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 21:10" />Ena, mibuguma jawo jangonjezeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:10">misenga jawo jangulela ne myana jawo kubagama.<verse eid="JOB 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 21:11" />Wana wa hewo wangudawala na kuvina,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:11">wanguvinaga waliyeka kwa kikala goya.<verse eid="JOB 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 21:12" />Wangwimbaga na ngoma na ving'hweleng'hwele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:12">na kusangalala kwa lizi lya mluli.<verse eid="JOB 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 21:13" />Wangulutilila goya kuli mhela weng'ha wa ukomu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:13">hamba wangudulikaga kuli isi ya wabagame kwa kikala goya.<verse eid="JOB 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 21:14" />Wangumlonjelaga Nguluwi, ‘Uleche kututunya!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:14">Hatulingugana kuzizela nzila za hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 21:15" />Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali ndo whaani mbaka tumkolele mijito?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:15">Topata chinhu chachi cha mzidi hotumlanda?’<verse eid="JOB 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 21:16" />Wehile wangilonjela kota wangulutilila goya kwa mong'ho wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:16">ila silingugakunda majesa ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 21:17" />“Hailingulawila mala nyinji kwa vyenje vya wehile kuzimigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">hawalingufichigwa na magazo chila mhela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:17">Nguluwi halinguwagaza hewo kwa vila kana ng'halazi lukami na hewo.<verse eid="JOB 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 21:18" />Ndaze, wehile wanguwaga kota mahamba gakalile hali mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:18">ama kota mhumba vyoilinguholigwa na chivuluvumbi?<verse eid="JOB 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 21:19" />Yangulonjigwa, ‘Nguluwi kanguwikaga ng'hano ya magazo ga munhu kwa chiwalo cha wanage,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:19">Nguluwi yamhilusile chibida acho heye yuye, leka yavizele!<verse eid="JOB 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 21:20" />Meho ga heye yuye gakone kudumigwa kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:20">heye yuye yafichigwe na kuzudila kwa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="JOB 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 21:21" />Yehile hoyobagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:21">howeza kijesa chiwele cholawila kuwala walelwa wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 21:22" />Kwa vila Nguluwi kangumtagusa chila yumwe, mbaka walingikala kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:22">haduhu yawele koweza kumlangusa chinhu choneche.<verse eid="JOB 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 21:23" />“Wanhu wamwenga wangubagama kuno wawele na mong'ho wa hewo weng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:23">wawele hali kikala goya na kusangalala,<verse eid="JOB 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 21:24" />wawele wanenehe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:24">na mizeje ja hewo jiwele jing'hali na mong'ho.<verse eid="JOB 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 21:25" />Wanji wangubagama wawele na masinzo ng'hatu mnhumbula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:25">wawele hawanawahika kujeza lyoneche linojile.<verse eid="JOB 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 21:26" />Hewo weng'ha wanguwasaga kuli nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:26">weng'ha wangugubikwa na mhiko.<verse eid="JOB 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 21:27" />“Mhulichize hemwe! Heni ndangugazela geng'ha gomlingijesa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:27">na majesa gehile kwa chiwalo cha kumbeza heni.<verse eid="JOB 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 21:28" />Mwanguuza, ‘Nakulawila choni kuli ng'handa ya wehile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:28">Ng'handa za wehile wakulu naziwifigwa.’<verse eid="JOB 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 21:29" />Ndaze, hamuwauzile wakola nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:29">hamijesile kuwala mbuli za wala wajenzi?<verse eid="JOB 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 21:30" />Wajenzi wangijesa kota mwihe kanguwichigwa kutali na zuwa lya kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:30">kangugomboligwa kuli zuwa lya kuzudila!<verse eid="JOB 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 21:31" />Whaani yomlonjeleza munhu yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:31">ama kumhilusila geng'ha goyaditile?<verse eid="JOB 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 21:32" />Hoyohilichigwa mchilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:32">chilaga cha heye changwamilwa.<verse eid="JOB 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 21:33" />Wanhu wenji wangumuwinza kumbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">na wanji wenji ng'hatu wangumlongola.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:33">Hoyotiligwa, misanga janguduliswaga mholemhole.<verse eid="JOB 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 21:34" />Lelo moweza ndaze kuhembuliza heni kwa ulonzi hela?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 21:34">Kwidichila kwa hemwe kwahela utanzi na ndo udesi hela.”<verse eid="JOB 21:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="JOB 22" />
  <para style="s">Elifasi kangulonga lwa kadatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 22:1" />Hamba Elifasi, Mtemani, nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 22:2" />“Ndaze, munhu kangutanza chinhu kwa Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:2">Ndaze, mbaka munhu yawele na luhala koweza kuwa na utanzi kwa heye?<verse eid="JOB 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 22:3" />Ndaze, kwangijesa kota kwangumdita Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali yasangalale kwa vila nakugoloka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:3">ama kangupata mzidi whachi wone hegwe kowa kwahela nongwa?<verse eid="JOB 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 22:4" />Kwangijesa kota kangukung'hanhuchila na kukugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:4">kwa vila hegwe kwangumhulichiza heye?<verse eid="JOB 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 22:5" />Hebu! Wihe wa hegwe ndo ukulu ng'hatu!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:5">Gehile ga hegwe gahela kuduma.<verse eid="JOB 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 22:6" />Nakuhola nguwo ya mng'holozo ya lehani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:6">nakumvula ivalo lya heye na kumleka yawele mwanzi.<verse eid="JOB 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 22:7" />Huwapele mazi wala wawele watochile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:7">ne chilyo wala wawele na nzala.<verse eid="JOB 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 22:8" />Hanga nawali na mong'ho, nakuihola isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:8">munhu uwele nawali uhulichizwa, nawikala amo,<verse eid="JOB 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 22:9" />nakuwaleka wafililwe na walume wa hewo walute moko yeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:9">nakuwabunza walekwa.<verse eid="JOB 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 22:10" />Ahyo midiwa najikuzunguluta banzi zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:10">ukabuso naukuvaba baho du.<verse eid="JOB 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 22:11" />Acho ndo chiwalo cha jiza kukufika leka uleche kona chinhu choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:11">na mazi tendema kukugubika.<verse eid="JOB 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 22:12" />Nguluwi kangikala kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">kusinda nhondwe ziwele kuchanya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:12">kuwele kangona chila chinhu.<verse eid="JOB 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 22:13" />Ila hegwe kwangulonga, ‘Nguluwi kanguvizela choni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:13">Ndaze, koweza kufyela hali ng'hungugu kulavya utaguso?<verse eid="JOB 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 22:14" />Ng'hungugu ng'hulu nazimzunguluta halinguchona chondilingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:14">heye kangujendaga kuuzunguluta ulanga wa isi!’<verse eid="JOB 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 22:15" />“Ndaze, nakwamula kuwinza nzila za katali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:15">ziwele wanhu wehile nawali woziwinza?<verse eid="JOB 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 22:16" />Hewo nawosigwa kuno mhela wa hewo ung'hali kufika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:16">misisi jawo najiholigwa na mazi tendema.<verse eid="JOB 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 22:17" />Hewo ndo wawele nawamlonjela Nguluwi, ‘Utuleche!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:17">Hegwe Nguluwi Uwele na Ludali koweza kudita choni hali hetwe?’<verse eid="JOB 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 22:18" />Ila Nguluwi ndo yamemeze vinhu vinojile kuli ng'handa za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:18">ahyo ndangiwika kutali na kiwika goya kwa wehile.<verse eid="JOB 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 22:19" />Wawele na hachi wangona kudumigwa kwa wehile, wangusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:19">walihela nongwa wanguwasekaga na kuwabeza,<verse eid="JOB 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 22:20" />wangulongaga ‘Kukomya, wang'honyo wa hetwe nawadumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:20">chila chowalechile nachilakazwa kwa chiluli.’<verse eid="JOB 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 22:21" />“Ayubu, wihanyise na Nguluwi leka uwe na kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:21">na mbuli za hegwe zolutilila goya.<verse eid="JOB 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 22:22" />Ubochele malanguso kulawa kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:22">na uwiche ulonzi wa heye mnhumbula mwa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 22:23" />Wone komhiluchila Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali, koditigwa uwe unyale kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:23">wone kowusa wihe leka uwe kutali na haluga ha hegwe,<verse eid="JOB 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 22:24" />wone kotoza kutali lufufu lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:24">zahabu ya Ofili hafungo ha lwanda,<verse eid="JOB 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 22:25" />hamba Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali kowa ndo zahabu ya hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:25">na sendi ya hegwe inojile,<verse eid="JOB 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 22:26" />ndikomya, nagwe kosangalala kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:26">na kumhejelela Nguluwi ne soni,<verse eid="JOB 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 22:27" />komlanda naye kokuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:27">nagwe kokweneza kulagana kwa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 22:28" />Choneche choukwamula cholutilila goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:28">lumuli lolangazila nzila za hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 22:29" />Kwa vila Nguluwi kanguwadulisaga walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:29">ila kanguwaloholaga walingunyenyetela.<verse eid="JOB 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 22:30" />Heye kangumloholaga munhu yalihela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 22:30">ena, hegwe koloholigwa wone kowa na madito ganojile.”<verse eid="JOB 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="JOB 23" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Elifasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 23:1" />Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 23:2" />“Lehano ndangung'ung'uta kwa usungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:2">kwa vila Nguluwi kangulutilila kungaza.<verse eid="JOB 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 23:3" />Wone ndahahazelele honhu hondimpata Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:3">ndahawezile kumhejelela.<verse eid="JOB 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 23:4" />Ndahamhilichile ulonjelezi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:4">na kilewela hali heye.<verse eid="JOB 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 23:5" />Ndahawezile kuvizela choyonyhidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:5">na choni choyondonjela.<verse eid="JOB 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 23:6" />Ndaze, yahatwanzile na heni kwa mong'ho ng'hatu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:6">Hebu! Ndikomya, yahanyhulichize.<verse eid="JOB 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 23:7" />Heye koweza kulongasa na munhu yagoloche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:7">Nguluwi, mtagusa wa heni, yahawezile kwamula kota ndahela nongwa mazuwa gose.<verse eid="JOB 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 23:8" />“Ulole, ndanguluta kumwando, silingumpata,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:8">ndanguhiluka kumbele, silingumona.<verse eid="JOB 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 23:9" />Hoyohinduchila ubanzi wa kumoso, silingumona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:9">hoyohinduchila ubanzi wa kudilo, silingumona ne hado.<verse eid="JOB 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 23:10" />Ila heye kanguizela nzila yondilinguiwinza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:10">hoyosinda kunjeza, ndolawa amo mbele kota zahabu inojile.<verse eid="JOB 23:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 23:11" />Ndanguzipala nzayo za heye kwa kukundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:11">ndanguiwinza nzila ya heye ne kugaluchila kumoso ama kudilo.<verse eid="JOB 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 23:12" />Silechile kibatilila mizilo ja heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:12">ulonzi wa heye nandiuwika mnhumbula mwa heni mazuwa gose.<verse eid="JOB 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 23:13" />Ila heye halingugaluka, whaani yoweza kumdita yagalamche?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:13">Choyalingugana ndo choyalingudita!<verse eid="JOB 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 23:14" />Kokweneza malajizo ga heye kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:14">menji kota ago ga kuli nyhala za heye.<verse eid="JOB 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 23:15" />Ahyo, ndangukakama kwa ukabuso hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:15">hondijesa kuwala heye, ndangufichigwa na kudumba.<verse eid="JOB 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 23:16" />Nguluwi nakaidita nhumbula ya heni itweguche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:16">Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali nakang'habusa.<verse eid="JOB 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 23:17" />Ila silinguditigwa nyamalile kwa chiwalo cha jiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 23:17">jiza totolo liwele naligubika kumeho kwa heni.”<verse eid="JOB 23:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="JOB 24" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangung'ung'uta kuwala wehile</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 24:1" />“Lekachoni Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali kahela mhela ulinguzeleka wa utaguso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:1">ama lekachoni walingumzela Nguluwi hambe wagazele ago mazuwa ga heye ga kigala hachi?<verse eid="JOB 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 24:2" />Wanhu wanguhejeza ulajilo wa mbaka ja migunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:2">wanji wanguhiza ming'holo na kujidima hamwe na vilundo vya migongolo ja hewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 24:3" />Wanguholaga midogowi ja walekwa na ibuguma lya mdala yafililwe na mlume wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:3">mbaka hoyosinda kulipa sendi zoyalingudaigwa.<verse eid="JOB 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 24:4" />Wanguwakundujizaga walihela chinhu leka waileche nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:4">na kuwadita wazunwa weng'ha wa isi wevise kwa kuwadumba hewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 24:5" />Kota idogowi lya kisolo liwele kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">wazunwa wangupalaga chilyo kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:5">leka wapate choneche cha kuwapa wana wa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 24:6" />Wazunwa wangulokotezaga mbena zisigale kuli migunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:6">wangulokotezaga zabibu kuli migunda ja wehile.<verse eid="JOB 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 24:7" />Nechilo yeng'ha wanguwasaga ne igolole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:7">mhela wa chipute wahela cha kigubika.<verse eid="JOB 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 24:8" />Wangudodaga kwa nhonya ya kuli chidunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:8">wangivisaga kuli mitalawe kwa vila wahela honhu ha kubilimila.<verse eid="JOB 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 24:9" />Wehile wanguwaholaga walekwa kwa lupichi kuli matombo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:9">na kuwahola wana wa wazunwa leka wawe lehani.<verse eid="JOB 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 24:10" />Wazunwa wangujendaga ne ikoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:10">wangupikaga nganda za ngano, ila wanguwa na nzala.<verse eid="JOB 24:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 24:11" />Wanguwagongomanjila wehile mafuta ga zeituni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:11">na kukama zabibu ne kujeza divai.<verse eid="JOB 24:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 24:12" />Chililo cha walingubagama changuhulikwa kulawa kuli muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">na wawele nawalumizwa wangutowa iyowe kulanda utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:12">ila Nguluwi halinguhulichiza kulanda kwa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 24:13" />“Wa baho wehile wanji walingubelenhuka lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">wohambe wazizele nzila za lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:13">hawalingugana kuzibata nzila za heye.<verse eid="JOB 24:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 24:14" />Yalingukopola kangwinukaga lufuku,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">kuwakopola ng'hochele na wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:14">loifika nechilo, mijito ja heye ndo kuhiza.<verse eid="JOB 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 24:15" />Mng'hondwa naye kangubetezaga jiza linjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">yochilonjela, ‘Haduhu yawele kombona.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:15">Hamba kanguvisa kumeho kwa heye kwa ivalo.<verse eid="JOB 24:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 24:16" />Nechilo, wahizi wangubenaga honhu ha ng'handa leka kwinjila mgati mwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">ila nemisi wangivisaga mgati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:16">kwa vila hawalingugana koneka hali lumuli.<verse eid="JOB 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 24:17" />Weng'ha awo, jiza totolo ndo lumuli lwa hamitondo kwa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:17">hewo kahi ndo goloko wa ukabuso wa jiza totolo.<verse eid="JOB 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 24:18" />“Ila mwangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">‘Wehile wanguholigwa himahima na mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">haluga ha hewo hangusigalaga kuwa isi ipanjilwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:18">ahyo, haduhu yalinguluta kuli migunda jawo ja mizabibu.’<verse eid="JOB 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 24:19" />Kota seluji vyoilingusungulumuka kuli ivuche na kugunuche</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:19">ndo kuli isi ya wabagame vyokulinguwahola walingudita gehile.<verse eid="JOB 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 24:20" />Lida liwapondile lyanguwasemwaga wanhu awo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:20">mhiko zolya ng'huli za hewo na kuziwifya kota igodi ligwile.<verse eid="JOB 24:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 24:21" />“Wehile wanguwabunzaga wadala walihela wana na mhende.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:21">Hawalinguwaditila ganojile wadala wafililwe na walume wa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 24:22" />Nguluwi kanguwadumyaga wawele na ludali kwa mong'ho wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:22">hanga nawalutilila goya, ila wahela makundo ga kikala lukami.<verse eid="JOB 24:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 24:23" />Kanguwalekaga wehile wewone kota wa hali kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:23">ila meho ga heye gangugalolaga madito ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 24:24" />Wehile wangulutilila goya kwa mhela udo hela, hamba wangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">wanguswinha kota ihamba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:24">wangutemigwa kota miso ja nyhule.<verse eid="JOB 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 24:25" />Whaani yoweza kutawiza kota heni nda mdesi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 24:25">na kuudita ulonzi wa heni woneche kota hauwele wa kukomya?”<verse eid="JOB 24:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="JOB 25" />
  <para style="s">Bilidadi kangumwidichila Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 25:1" />Bilidadi, Mshuhi, nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 25:2" />“Nguluwi ndo yawele na ludali lukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">wanhu weng'ha wamdumbe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:2">Heye kangutawizaga kikala goya mbaka kuchanya kilanga.<verse eid="JOB 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 25:3" />Whaani yoweza kuwawaza wamizi wa heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:3">Whaani yawele halingulangazilwa na lumuli lwa heye?<verse eid="JOB 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 25:4" />Lelo munhu yapondigwe na mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:4">koweza ndaze kuwa yatanganiche na yelile hali Nguluwi?<verse eid="JOB 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 25:5" />Wone kwa heye Nguluwi, mbaka nyelezi hailingupulika goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:5">nhondwe nazo haziwele zinojile hali heye,<verse eid="JOB 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 25:6" />yowa ndaze kwa munhu yawele ndo fukuzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 25:6">yawele ndo mhiko hela?”<verse eid="JOB 25:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="JOB 26" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Bilidadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 26:1" />Ayubu nakedichila,<verse eid="JOB 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 26:2" />“Ulole, nda ng'hochele na ndahela utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">nagwe haunhanzile ne hado!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:2">Ndaze, kwangijesa kota nakunhanza lukami?<verse eid="JOB 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 26:3" />Ndaze vyoundonjele ndilihela luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:3">na kumha heni uwanzi wa hegwe mwinji!<verse eid="JOB 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 26:4" />Whaani yakutanzile nakulonga ulonzi awo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:4">Ndo muhe wa whaani ulonjile kulawa kuli mlomo wa hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 26:5" />“Mihoka jiwele ako hasi jangudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:5">jangukakama mgati mwa mazi ga hasi ha isi.<verse eid="JOB 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 26:6" />Kuli isi ya wabagame kwa mwanzi ng'hatu hali Nguluwi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:6">Kuwifya kwahela chigubiko choneche.<verse eid="JOB 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 26:7" />Nguluwi kanguusambalulaga ulanga wa kasikazini hali honhu halihela chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:7">na kuininiza isi kuli honhu halihela chinhu cha kuibatilila.<verse eid="JOB 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 26:8" />Kangugahindilaga mazi kuli ng'hungugu yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:8">nayo ng'hungugu hailingutulika kwa itunyo lyake.<verse eid="JOB 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 26:9" />Kanguigubikaga nyelezi ikangale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:9">kwa kutandazula ng'hungugu mchanya mwake.<verse eid="JOB 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 26:10" />Nakawika msitali wa upeo kugawanula ulanga na mazi ga bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:10">leka uwe mbaka wa lumuli na jiza.<verse eid="JOB 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 26:11" />Mizengo ja ulanga najo jangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:11">jangukabuswa hoyojing'hanuchila.<verse eid="JOB 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 26:12" />Kwa mong'ho wa heye nakaidita bahali isindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:12">kwa uwanzi wa heye nakachikopola chilumbigwe chikulu cha kuli bahali chilinguchemigwa Lahabu.<verse eid="JOB 26:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 26:13" />Kwa lweselo lwa heye nakauhovuga ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:13">moko wa heye nauchikopola chilumbigwe acho, izoka lilingusulupuka.<verse eid="JOB 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 26:14" />Azi ndo mbuli ndodo hela kuli madito ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">natuhulika kupwepwa kudo hela kuwala heye!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 26:14">Lelo whaani yoweza kuuzela ukulu wa mong'ho wa heye?”<verse eid="JOB 26:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="JOB 27" />
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa kuduma wa Ayubu kwa goloko wa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 27:1" />Ayubu nakalutilila kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 27:2" />“Ndangilaha kwa Nguluwi yawele mkomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">yayusile hachi ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:2">Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali yaiditile nhumbula ya heni iwe na usungu!<verse eid="JOB 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 27:3" />Kwa mhela weng'ha hondiwa mkomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:3">nalo lweselo lwa Nguluwi holuwa mgati mwa heni,<verse eid="JOB 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 27:4" />mlomo wa heni haulavya ulonzi wa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:4">ne umyango wa heni kulonga uhadi.<verse eid="JOB 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 27:5" />Siweza kukunda kota hemwe mwangulonga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:5">mbaka hondibagama ndolutilila kulonga kota siditile nongwa yoneche.<verse eid="JOB 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 27:6" />Ndanguvizela kota nandita mbuli zitanganiche ne kuleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:6">kuli ukomu wa heni, nhumbula ya heni hailingunhagusa.<verse eid="JOB 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 27:7" />“Weng'ha walingitwanza na heni wawazigwe kota wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:7">wang'honyo wa heni wagazigwe kota wawele na gehile.<verse eid="JOB 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 27:8" />Yohambe yamdumbe Nguluwi kangitumbila choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">mhela Nguluwi hoyomdumya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:8">hoyokusa ukomu wa heye?<verse eid="JOB 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 27:9" />Ndaze, hoyofichigwa na magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:9">Nguluwi kohulika chililo cha heye?<verse eid="JOB 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 27:10" />Ndaze, mwihe koweza kusangalala hali Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:10">na kulutilila kumlanda Nguluwi chila mhela?<verse eid="JOB 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 27:11" />Ndowalangusa kuwala mong'ho wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:11">siwavisa kuwala mbuli za Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali.<verse eid="JOB 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 27:12" />Ila hemwe mwanguizela goya ng'hatu mbuli ayo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:12">Lekachoni lelo mwangulutilila kulonga upoka?<verse eid="JOB 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 27:13" />“Achi ndo chinhu chiwele Nguluwi nakachiwika kwa chiwalo cha mwihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:13">uhalizi uwele yalingubunza koubochela kulawa kwa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali ndo awu,<verse eid="JOB 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 27:14" />hanga wana wa heye wowa wenji lukami, ila wobagama kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:14">walelwa wa heye hawowa na chilyo cha kuhega.<verse eid="JOB 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 27:15" />Walelwa wawele wosigala, wobagama kwa matamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:15">nawo wadala wa hewo hawowalombochezela.<verse eid="JOB 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 27:16" />Hoyokungajiza sendi kota nhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:16">na mivalo kota vilundo vya ilongo,<verse eid="JOB 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 27:17" />mleche yewichile, ila yawele na hachi kojivala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:17">na sendi za heye, walihela nongwa wochigawila.<verse eid="JOB 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 27:18" />Ng'handa yalinguzenga mwihe ndo kota utandawala wa ibui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:18">kota chibumuli cha mwamizi kumgunda.<verse eid="JOB 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 27:19" />Heye kanguwasaga yawele na lufufu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:19">hoyokwinuka, lufufu lwa heye lwangwajililaga!<verse eid="JOB 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 27:20" />Ukabuso wangumfikaga kota mazi tendema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:20">nechilo kangufichigwa na chivuluvumbi.<verse eid="JOB 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 27:21" />Mbeho ya kolilawilaga isanya yangumholaga, naye kangwajililaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:21">yangumnyasulaga kulawa haluga hake.<verse eid="JOB 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 27:22" />Mbeho ayo yangumvabaga ne isungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:22">hoyojeza kubilima.<verse eid="JOB 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 27:23" />Mbeho yomtunya kwa lizi lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 27:23">na kumkabusa kulawa honhu hake.<verse eid="JOB 27:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="JOB 28" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi yaliyeka ndo yalinguvizela holuwele luhala</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 28:1" />“Zahabu na sendi vyangubawigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:1">hamba vyangwelizwa.<verse eid="JOB 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 28:2" />Hihyo du kuli shaba na chuma.<verse eid="JOB 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 28:3" />Walingubawa maganga ga sendi nyinji mbaka wangulemwela kubawa hasi lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">wangigalaga vyenje kuli jiza totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:3">kwa chiwalo cha kupala vinhu avyo.<verse eid="JOB 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 28:4" />Wangubawaga mikulubila kutali na kowalingikala wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">hali honhu hawele wala wawele kuli majendo hawalingufika.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">Wangukola mijito kutali ng'hatu na wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:4">woninila kudulika kuli mikulubila ajo wawele wawopigwe ng'weso.<verse eid="JOB 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 28:5" />Chilyo changulawa kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:5">ila hasi ha misanga, walingubawa maganga ga sendi nyinji wangubwina chiluli leka kubena mitalawe.<verse eid="JOB 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 28:6" />Kuli mitalawe ajo hana vinhu vya lanji ya yakuti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:6">na nhimbwisi ya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 28:7" />Haduhu ikungule liwele nalinjila kuli mikulubila ajo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:7">ne chilutema kujona.<verse eid="JOB 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 28:8" />Haliwele isimba ama igongolo linji ling'hang'hale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:8">liwele nalikola kuli nzila azo.<verse eid="JOB 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 28:9" />Munhu kangutula mitalawe jigagadale ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:9">kanguvibawaga vidunda na kuvyusa ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 28:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 28:10" />Kangubawaga nyhinda kuli mitalawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:10">iziho lya heye lyangonaga vinhu vya sendi nyinji.<verse eid="JOB 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 28:11" />Kangudinyhaga nzasa zileche kuchililika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:11">na kuvigala kuli lumuli vinhu vivisile.<verse eid="JOB 28:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 28:12" />“Ila kulufika luhala ndo mijito jing'ang'ale ng'hatu kusinda kuvifika vinhu avyo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:12">Ndaze, koweza kulona kohi?<verse eid="JOB 28:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 28:13" />Haduhu munhu yalinguuzela utanzi wa luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:13">halulingoneka kuli isi ya wawele wakomu.<verse eid="JOB 28:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 28:14" />Mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi hangulonga, ‘Luhala lwa haduhu kwa hetwe,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:14">nayo bahali yangulonga, ‘Haluwele kwa heni.’<verse eid="JOB 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 28:15" />Luhala haluweza kuguligwa kwa zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:15">ne kwa chasi chikulu cha sendi.<verse eid="JOB 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 28:16" />Halulingupimigwa kwa zahabu ya Ofili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">ne maganga galingupulika ga sendi nyinji ga salidoniki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:16">ama kwa yakuti ya samawati.<verse eid="JOB 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 28:17" />Zahabu ama maganga galingupulika havilingiwhana nalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:17">luna utanzi kusinda mibuli ja zahabu zinojile.<verse eid="JOB 28:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 28:18" />Luhala luna lutogo ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:18">kusinda matumbawe na lulu za mbahali.<verse eid="JOB 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 28:19" />Maganga ga sendi nyinji galinguchemigwa topazi ga Kushi hagalingiwhanizwa nalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:19">ne kuguligwa kwa chasi cha zahabu inojile.<verse eid="JOB 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 28:20" />“Lelo luhala lwangulawila kohi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:20">Kohi koulingoneka uwanzi?<verse eid="JOB 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 28:21" />Naluvisigwa kutali na meho ga vilumbigwe vyeng'ha vikomu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:21">mbaka videje vya kilanga havilinguweza kulona.<verse eid="JOB 28:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 28:22" />Kuwifya na kubagama vyangulongaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:22">‘Natuhulika lizi lyake hela.’<verse eid="JOB 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 28:23" />“Nguluwi kanguizela nzila ya kuluta kuli luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:23">heye yaliyeka ndo yalinguvizela holulingoneka,<verse eid="JOB 28:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 28:24" />kwa vila heye kangulolaga mbaka kuli kuduma kwa isi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:24">na kangonaga chila chinhu chiwele hasi ha ulanga.<verse eid="JOB 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 28:25" />Loyauditile mong'ho wa mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:25">na kwamula kuwala mbaka ja mazi,<verse eid="JOB 28:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 28:26" />loyawichile malajizo kwa chiwalo cha nhonya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:26">na nzila kwa chiwalo cha lumwemwesa lwa limlungu,<verse eid="JOB 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 28:27" />nakamula kuluzelesa luhala na kuluwikula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:27">na kulutawiza kota ndo lunoga.<verse eid="JOB 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 28:28" />“Hamba Nguluwi nakawalonjela wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">‘Mlole! Kumdumba Mkulu Nguluwi ndo luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 28:28">na kiwika kutali na gehile ndo kuvizela.’ ”<verse eid="JOB 28:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="JOB 29" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangugakumbuchila mazuwa ga kulutilila goya kwa heye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 29:1" />Ayubu nakalutilila kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 29:2" />“Wone ndahawele kota vyombele katali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:2">mhela wula uwele Nguluwi nayali yonyamila,<verse eid="JOB 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 29:3" />mhela chenje cha heye lochiwele cholangazila kumutwi kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:3">kwa lumuli lwa Nguluwi nang'hola hagati ha jiza.<verse eid="JOB 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 29:4" />Kota vyombele na mong'ho kuli usongolo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:4">mhela Nguluwi loyawele nakaitambichiza ng'handa ya heni,<verse eid="JOB 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 29:5" />mhela uwele Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali nayali hamwe na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:5">nawo wana wa heni nawali wanzungulute,<verse eid="JOB 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 29:6" />misenga ja heni najingalila matombo menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:6">na migodi ja mizeituni najilavya mafuta menji lukami.<verse eid="JOB 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 29:7" />“Londutile kuli lwizi lwa muji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:7">na kikalisa kuli chalanza hali nhing'hano ya wasekulu,<verse eid="JOB 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 29:8" />wasongolo lowambonile nawema hafungo kwa kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:8">nawo wasekulu nawema kwa kuhulichiza.<verse eid="JOB 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 29:9" />Wakulu nawaleka kulonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:9">na kudinya milomo jawo kwa moko ga hewo,<verse eid="JOB 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 29:10" />vilongozi nawalonjelwa wanyamalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:10">kahi nawagubika milomo ja hewo leka wanyhulichize.<verse eid="JOB 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 29:11" />Chila yawele nakahulika mbuli za heni nakanganila ganojile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:11">na yoneche yawele nakambona, nakanhogola.<verse eid="JOB 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 29:12" />Nandimlohola mzunwa yalingulanda utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:12">na mlekwa yalihela munhu wa kumtanza.<verse eid="JOB 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 29:13" />Wawele nawali habehi kubagama nawanhambichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:13">nandizidita nhumbula za wafililwe na walume wa hewo zisangalale.<verse eid="JOB 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 29:14" />Kutanganika nakwali ndo ivalo lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:14">hachi nayali ndo ikanzu lya heni na chipembelo cha heni.<verse eid="JOB 29:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 29:15" />Kwa wohambe walole nandali meho ga kuwalajila nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:15">kwa vyete nandali magulu ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 29:16" />Kwa ng'hochele nandali mhaza wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:16">nandikangaza kulewela hachi za wajenzi.<verse eid="JOB 29:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 29:17" />Nandijibena mizino jing'hang'hale ja wehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:17">na kusukula upelembi kulawa kuli milomo jawo.<verse eid="JOB 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 29:18" />Hamba nandijesa, ‘Ndochikala kwa kusangalala na kwa mhela winji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:18">hamba ndobagama mbele mchinhanda mwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 29:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 29:19" />Kuli mazuwa ago nandali nzinzili,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">kota igodi liwele mizabi jake najiluta hasi ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:19">na jina mazi menji lukami.<verse eid="JOB 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 29:20" />Ukulu wa heni wosigala uwele unyale mnhumbula mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:20">mazuwa gose mong'ho wa heni wowa kota upinde unyale.’<verse eid="JOB 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 29:21" />“Mhela awo wanhu nawali wonyhulichiza na kubeteza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:21">nawali wasindamale wobeteza chondilonga.<verse eid="JOB 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 29:22" />Losindile kulonga hawawele na cha konjeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:22">ulonzi wa heni nawinjila goya kuli makutu ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 29:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 29:23" />Wanhu nawambeteza heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:23">kota vyowalinguibeteza nhonya mhela wa chipalangule.<verse eid="JOB 29:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 29:24" />Vyowagozole, nandiwalajila kumeho kusangalale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:24">lumuli lwa kumeho kwa heni nalwali utanzi kwa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 29:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 29:25" />Nandiwalongola kuwalajila nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">nandali kota mndewa hali wamizi wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 29:25">kota yalinguwahembuliza walingulombocheza.<verse eid="JOB 29:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="JOB 30" />
  <para style="s">Wanhu wangumbeza Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 30:1" />“Ila sambi wanhu wangumbeza heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">wanhu wawele wadodo kusinda heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">wawele wahaza wa hewo nandiwalema ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:1">mbaka siwakundize kujitanza mibwa ja heni jilingwamila ming'holo ja heni.<verse eid="JOB 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 30:2" />Ndahawele na utanzi whachi kulawa kuli moko ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:2">wanhu wawele mong'ho wa hewo naumala,<verse eid="JOB 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 30:3" />wawele nawalubaluba nechilo kuli isi ilihela mazi na ilechigwe uchiwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:3">kuno wagandile kwa nzala?<verse eid="JOB 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 30:4" />Kuli visosolo nawakungajiza mizuchila ja kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:4">chilyo cha hewo nachali mizabi ja migodi ja isuyo.<verse eid="JOB 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 30:5" />Nawawinjigwa leka wawe kutali na wanhu wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:5">kuno wowatowela iyowe kota wahizi.<verse eid="JOB 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 30:6" />Naiwagana kikala kuli nzanda zikalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:6">kuli mitalawe na mikulubila.<verse eid="JOB 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 30:7" />Kuli visosolo nawalila kota midogowi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:7">nawekungajiza hamwe hali chipete.<verse eid="JOB 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 30:8" />Hewo ndo wapoka kota wahaza na wamamo wa hewo, wawele ndo mwaluko wa wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:8">wawele nawawinjigwa kuli isi.<verse eid="JOB 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 30:9" />“Wana wa hewo wangumbeza heni kwa nzimbo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:9">nandiwa chinhu cha kusecheza kwa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 30:10" />Wangunzudila ng'hatu na wangikala kutali na heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:10">ila howombona hawalinguleka kunhemela mite kumeho.<verse eid="JOB 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 30:11" />Nguluwi nakandita ndiwe ng'hochele na kumbasa soni heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:11">lelo wangunditila kota vyowalingugana.<verse eid="JOB 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 30:12" />Kudilo kwa heni chilundo changunhowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">wangumbichila idiwa kuli magulu ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:12">wangiwika goya kundumya.<verse eid="JOB 30:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 30:13" />Wangulemezaga nzila ya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">wangunyhilikaga kuli kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:13">ndahela yoneche wa kunhanza.<verse eid="JOB 30:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 30:14" />Nawatula lukanzi na kufyela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:14">nawenjila na kunhowa.<verse eid="JOB 30:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 30:15" />Ukabuso naungubika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">kuhulichiza kwa heni nakusigwa kota mbeho vyoilinguwembelusa chinhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:15">kikala goya kwa heni nakwajilila kota ng'hungugu.<verse eid="JOB 30:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 30:16" />“Lelo ndahela mong'ho woneche mnhumbula mwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:16">mazuwa ga magazo nagafika heni.<verse eid="JOB 30:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 30:17" />Mizeje ja heni jangutama kuli mhela wa nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:17">usungu wangundakula, haulingusindamala.<verse eid="JOB 30:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 30:18" />Nguluwi nakaidinga singo ya heni kwa ivalo lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:18">nakaidinya singo ya heni kota kola ya ikanzu lya heni.<verse eid="JOB 30:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 30:19" />Nakanhoza kuli nhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:19">nandiwa kota mivu na nhimbwisi.<verse eid="JOB 30:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 30:20" />Gwa Nguluwi, ndangukulilila ila haulingunyhidichila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:20">ndangwima, ila kwangundola hela.<verse eid="JOB 30:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 30:21" />Nakugaluka na kuwa ulihela isungu kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:21">kwangunhowa kwa moko wa hegwe uwele na mong'ho.<verse eid="JOB 30:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 30:22" />Kwangunyhasula na kunyhembelusa kwa mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:22">nakunhoza aku na kula kuli chivuluvumbi.<verse eid="JOB 30:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 30:23" />Ndanguvizela kota konyhilika mbaka kuli kubagama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:23">honhu hawele nawawichilwa weng'ha wawele wakomu, howobagama.<verse eid="JOB 30:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 30:24" />“Ndaze, wone munhu yafichigwe na kudumigwa halingwinula moko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:24">Ndaze, wone munhu yawe kuli magazo halingulanda utanzi?<verse eid="JOB 30:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 30:25" />Ndaze, siwalilile wala wawele kuli magazo?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:25">Ndaze, nhumbula ya heni haiwele na isungu kwa chiwalo cha wazunwa?<verse eid="JOB 30:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 30:26" />Ila vyombele nditumbila ganojile, gehile nagafika kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:26">vyombele ndipala lumuli, jiza nalyuya kwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 30:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 30:27" />Mazuwa gose nhumbula ya heni yangusanzalima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:27">mazuwa ga magazo nagafika kwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 30:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 30:28" />Ndangukola ndilombocheza, kikala kwa heni kwahela lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:28">ndangwima hazelu kulanda utanzi.<verse eid="JOB 30:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 30:29" />Ndangulila kota mikanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:29">lizi lya kulila kwa heni lyangiwhana na lizi lya mituwe.<verse eid="JOB 30:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 30:30" />Ngozi ya heni naiwa nhitu na yangukubuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:30">mizeje ja heni jangulakala kwa ivuche lya kutamika.<verse eid="JOB 30:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 30:31" />Ching'weleng'wele cha heni nachiwa cha kulombochezela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 30:31">mluli wa heni nauwa lizi lya chililo.<verse eid="JOB 30:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="JOB 31" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 31:1" />“Nandita ilagano na meho ga heni</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:1">galeche kumlola mhinza kwa maya.<verse eid="JOB 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 31:2" />Ndaze, ndangubeteza chinhu chachi kulawa kwa Nguluwi yawele kuchanya?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:2">Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali nakambichila chinhu chachi?<verse eid="JOB 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 31:3" />Ndaze, kubagama hakulinguwafika wehile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:3">na kudumya kwa wala walingudita gehile?<verse eid="JOB 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 31:4" />Ndaze, Nguluwi halinguzona nzila za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:4">ne kugazela madito ga heni geng'ha?<verse eid="JOB 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 31:5" />“Wone nandikala kuli udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:5">ama magulu ga heni nagabilimila kuli uhadi,<verse eid="JOB 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 31:6" />Nguluwi yamhime kuli mizani ja hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:6">naye kovizela kota ndahela nongwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 31:7" />Wone magulu ga heni nagasochela nzila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">ama nhumbula ya heni nailongozwa na meho ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:7">ama moko ga heni nagawifigwa na ukokomoche,<verse eid="JOB 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 31:8" />lelo wanji walye chondinyalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:8">mizuchila ja heni jiwele kumgunda jing'humbuligwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 31:9" />“Wone nandali na maya kwa mche wa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:9">wone nandimbeteza hali lwizi lwa yalingikalasa habehi na heni,<verse eid="JOB 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 31:10" />lelo mchewangu yamtelechele mlume yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:10">na walume wanji wawase naye.<verse eid="JOB 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 31:11" />Kwa heni kudita ahyo yahawele soni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:11">ena, gehile ga kutagusigwa.<verse eid="JOB 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 31:12" />Gehile ga heni gahawele ndo chiluli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:12">chiwele chahalakaze mbena za heni.<verse eid="JOB 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 31:13" />Wone nandema kubochela ulonjelezi kulawa kwa chitumagwa wa heni, mlume ama mdala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:13">loyangalile kung'ung'uta kwa heye kuwala heni,<verse eid="JOB 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 31:14" />lelo ndodita choni hondiwa hali Nguluwi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:14">Ndomwidichila ndaze hoyombuza kuwala mbuli ayo?<verse eid="JOB 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 31:15" />Nguluwi yawele nakangongomanya, ndo yuye yawele nakamlumba chitumagwa wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:15">ndikomya, heye yaliyeka ndo yatulumbile hetwe tweng'ha mmunda mwa wamamo wa hetwe.<verse eid="JOB 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 31:16" />“Ndaze, siwapele wazunwa vinhu vyowalinguganigwa kupegwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:16">ama kuwadita wadala wafililwe na walume wa hewo wajilize kitumbila kwa hewo?<verse eid="JOB 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 31:17" />Ndaze nandilya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:17">ne kihanza na walekwa?<verse eid="JOB 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 31:18" />Hebu! Kulawa kuli usongolo wa heni nandali ndimlola mlekwa kota vila mhaza yahaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:18">kahi nandiwalongoza wadala wafililwe na walume wa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 31:19" />Ndaze, nandimona munhu yalingugazika kwa chipute,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:19">ama mzunwa yalihela mivalo,<verse eid="JOB 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 31:20" />yawele halonjile malumbo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:20">kwa kumha ivuche kwa mivalo ja milaika ja ming'holo ja heni?<verse eid="JOB 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 31:21" />Wone nangolola moko wa heni leka kumkabusa mlekwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:21">kuno ndivizela kota wakulu wa chitala wonganilila,<verse eid="JOB 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 31:22" />lelo moko wa heni ulawe kuli iyega lyake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:22">nawo ubeneche kulawa honhu hake.<verse eid="JOB 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 31:23" />Kwa vila nandali ndigadumba magazo kulawa kwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:23">kwa kuudumba ukulu wa heye, siwezile kudita mbuli kota azo.<verse eid="JOB 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 31:24" />“Wone nandiidita zahabu kuwa ndo kitumbila kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:24">ama, nandiilonjela zahabu inojile, ‘Hegwe ndo kikala goya kwa heni,’<verse eid="JOB 31:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 31:25" />wone nasangalala kwa winji wa lufufu lwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:25">ama kidayila chondilingupata kwa moko ga heni,<verse eid="JOB 31:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 31:26" />wone nandililola isanya holikwaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:26">na nyelezi hoilingukola kwa kunoga kwake,<verse eid="JOB 31:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 31:27" />wone kahi nhumbula ya heni naihadigwa kuvifugamila avyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:27">ama kuvitogola,<verse eid="JOB 31:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 31:28" />ago kahi gahawele gehile ga kutagusigwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:28">kwa vila kudita mbuli azo ndo kota kumlema Nguluwi Yawele Kuchanya.<verse eid="JOB 31:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 31:29" />“Ndaze, nasangalala kwa kudumigwa kwa mng'honyo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:29">ama kumseka hala loyafichigwe na magazo?<verse eid="JOB 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 31:30" />Siukundize mlomo wa heni ulonje gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:30">kwa kulanda upanjilo ufiche kuli kikala kwa heye.<verse eid="JOB 31:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 31:31" />Vitumagwa wa heni weng'ha wanguvizela hazelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:31">kota mhela weng'ha nandali ndiwabochela wajenzi.<verse eid="JOB 31:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 31:32" />Haduhu mjenzi yawele nakawasa hanze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:32">kwa vila lwizi lwa heni nalwali mwanzi kwa yalingukola mnzila.<verse eid="JOB 31:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 31:33" />Ndaze, navisa gehile ga heni kota wanhu wanji vyowalingudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:33">ama nandema kulonga gehile ga heni?<verse eid="JOB 31:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 31:34" />Sidumbile kwima na kulonga hali ikugusi lya wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">sinyamalile ama kihindila mgati,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:34">kwa kudumba kukabuswa kwa kubeza kwa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 31:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 31:35" />Lekachoni Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">halingunyhulichiza na kunyhidichila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">Wone Nguluwi yahawele na ulonjelezi kuwala heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:35">mleche yalonje ama kwandika kuwala nongwa ya heni!<verse eid="JOB 31:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 31:36" />Ndikomya, ndahaipichile mmayega,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:36">ama ndahaivalile kumutwi kota itaji leka chila munhu yayone.<verse eid="JOB 31:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 31:37" />Ndahamlonjele Nguluwi chila chinhu chonditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:37">kwa kudita ahyo, ndahalutile kwa heye kota mwana wa mndewa.<verse eid="JOB 31:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 31:38" />Wone nanyhola mgunda kwa lupichi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:38">kulawa kwa yawele na mgunda awo,<verse eid="JOB 31:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 31:39" />na wone nandilya mbena za mgunda awo ne kulipa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:39">na kwambuza kubagama kwa yawele na mgunda awo kwa nzala,<verse eid="JOB 31:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 31:40" />lelo miwa jote amo honhu ha ngano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 31:40">na migugu honhu ha shayili.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JOB 31:40">Kuduma kwa ulonzi wa Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 31:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="JOB 32" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kanguwang'hanuchila goloko wa Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 32:1" />Lelo goloko awo wadatu wa Ayubu, wawele ndo Elifasi na Bilidadi na Sofali nawaleka kumwidichila Ayubu kwa vila Ayubu naketawiza yuye kota kahela nongwa. <verse eid="JOB 32:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 32:2" />Ila Elihu, mwana wa Balakeli, wa nhanzi ya Busi, wa lukolo lwa Lamu, nakamzudila ng'hatu Ayubu kwa chiwalo cha kiwona kota kana hachi na kijesa kota Nguluwi nakamgaza ne chiwalo. <verse eid="JOB 32:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 32:3" />Kahi nakawazudila awo goloko wadatu wa Ayubu kwa vila nawalonga kota Ayubu nayali na nongwa nyinji, ila hawawezile kumdita Ayubu yagaluse majesa ga heye, kota chowalonjile nachali cha kukomya. Kwa kudita ahyo, nayoneka kota Nguluwi kana nongwa. <verse eid="JOB 32:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 32:4" />Mhela uwele wasekulu lowawele wolongasa na Ayubu, Elihu nayali yanyamalile kwa vila heye nayali msongolo kusinda hewo. <verse eid="JOB 32:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 32:5" />Ila Elihu loyawene wanhu awo wadatu wahela ulonzi wa mzidi wa kumwidichila Ayubu, nakazudila ng'hatu. <verse eid="JOB 32:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 32:6" />Lelo Elihu nakulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">“Heni nda msongolo, hemwe ndo wasekulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:6">ahyo nandumba kuwalonjela chondilingijesa.<verse eid="JOB 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 32:7" />Nandilonjela mnhumbula, ‘Waleche wawele na mazuwa menji walonje,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:7">wawele na miyaka minji walanguse luhala.’<verse eid="JOB 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 32:8" />Ila awo muhe uwele mgati mwa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">muhe wa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:8">ndo ulingumdita munhu yawe na kuvizela.<verse eid="JOB 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 32:9" />Hawawele wasekulu waliyeka wawele na luhala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:9">ama wawele na miyaka minji ng'hatu walinguvizela kwamula kwa hachi.<verse eid="JOB 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 32:10" />Ahyo ndangulonga, ‘Mnyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:10">nani ndiwalonjele chila chondilingijesa.’<verse eid="JOB 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 32:11" />“Heni nambeteza hala homuwele mlonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">nanyhulichiza ulonzi wa luhala womuulonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:11">vyomuwele mpala ulonzi wa kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 32:12" />Nandiwahulichiza goya ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">ila haduhu ne yumwe hali hemwe yawele nakamsumya Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:12">mweng'ha namlemwela kwidichila ulonzi wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 32:13" />Milolele mleche kulonga, ‘Lelo natupegwa luhala.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:13">Nguluwi komsumya, ila hawele munhu.’<verse eid="JOB 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 32:14" />Ulonzi wa Ayubu hauwele kwa chiwalo cha heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:14">ahyo simwidichila kota vyommwidichile hemwe.<verse eid="JOB 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 32:15" />“Nambubuwala, namlemwela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:15">mwahela ulonzi wa kulonga kahi.<verse eid="JOB 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 32:16" />Ndaze, ndutilile kubeteza hela kwa vila hamlingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:16">mwangunyamalila hela ne kwidichila chinhu?<verse eid="JOB 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 32:17" />Nani ndolavya ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:17">ndowa na chinhu cha kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 32:18" />Ndanawo ulonzi mwinji ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:18">nhumbula ya heni yangung'hundujiza kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 32:19" />Mgati mwa heni nda kota ibuli limemile mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:19">kota mazi galinguhemla lukami gawele habehi kubohoka.<verse eid="JOB 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 32:20" />Ndanguganigwa kulonga leka heni sindamale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:20">yangundapa ngubule mlomo wa heni na kwidichila.<verse eid="JOB 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 32:21" />Simganilila munhu yoneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:21">ne kulavya ulonzi wa kumhembuliza munhu,<verse eid="JOB 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 32:22" />kwa vila wone ndahawele goya kiwika habehi na munhu kwa chiwalo cha kugana kupata chinhu kulawa kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 32:22">Nguluwi yahandumye.”<verse eid="JOB 32:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="JOB 33" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kangumng'hanuchila Ayubu</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 33:1" />“Lelo Ayubu uhulichize ulonzi wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:1">uwiche goya makutu ga hegwe kuli chila chinhu chondilonga.<verse eid="JOB 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 33:2" />Ulole, ndangugubula mlomo wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:2">ena, umyango wa heni wolonga.<verse eid="JOB 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 33:3" />Kulawa kuli nhumbula ya heni igoloche, ndanguvizela kota ndangulonga kukomya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:3">na ulonzi wa heni ndo wa kukundigwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 33:4" />Muhe wa Nguluwi naungongomanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:4">lweselo lwa Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali lwangumha heni ukomu.<verse eid="JOB 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 33:5" />Wone kwanguweza, unyhidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:5">wiwiche goya kulongasa na heni.<verse eid="JOB 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 33:6" />Heni na hegwe ndo chinhu chimwe hali Mkulu Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:6">nani kahi nangongomanywa kwa ilongo.<verse eid="JOB 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 33:7" />Ahyo haulinguganigwa kundumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:7">ulonzi wa heni hauweza kuwa itunyo kwa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 33:8" />“Nandikuhulika louwele ulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:8">awu ndo ulonzi wouulonjile,<verse eid="JOB 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 33:9" />‘Ndahela nongwa, siditile wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:9">nandiwika kutali na gehile.<verse eid="JOB 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 33:10" />Ila Nguluwi kangupala nongwa kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:10">na kangunditila kota nda mng'honyo wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 33:11" />Kangugawoha magulu ga heni kwa minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:11">na kuzilola ng'hatu nzila za heni zeng'ha.’<verse eid="JOB 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 33:12" />“Ila heni ndangukulonjela, kuli mbuli ayi hegwe kuna nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:12">kwa vila Nguluwi ndo mkulu kusinda munhu.<verse eid="JOB 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 33:13" />Lekachoni kwangumng'ung'utila heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:13">kwa kulonga kota homwidichila munhu?<verse eid="JOB 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 33:14" />Nguluwi kangulongaga na hetwe kwa nzila zilivinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:14">ila haduhu munhu yalingijesa kuwala mbuli ayo.<verse eid="JOB 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 33:15" />Nguluwi kangulongaga na wanhu kuli mhela wa nechilo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:15">kuli usinjizi, howowa wolota,<verse eid="JOB 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 33:16" />kanguwadita wahulichize choyalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:16">na kuwadita wadumbe kwa makanyo ga heye,<verse eid="JOB 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 33:17" />leka waleche madito ga hewo gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:17">na kuwadita wewiche kutali na kidaya.<verse eid="JOB 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 33:18" />Kwa kudita ahyo, kangumwamilaga munhu yaleche kudumigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:18">na kumlohola kulawa kuli kubagama yang'hali msongolo.<verse eid="JOB 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 33:19" />“Mhela wunji Nguluwi kangumkanyaga munhu kwa kumigalila utamwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:19">na usungu lukami kuli vitomo vya lukuli lwa heye,<verse eid="JOB 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 33:20" />naye kangwajilizaga maya ga kulya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:20">mbaka chilyo chinojile changumzudizaga.<verse eid="JOB 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 33:21" />Lukuli lwa heye lwangugandaga lukami mbaka howeza kukumbuchilwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:21">na mizeje ja lukuli lwa heye jochilajila.<verse eid="JOB 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 33:22" />Ka habehi ng'hatu kwinjila mchilaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:22">kuluta kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="JOB 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 33:23" />Hanji mhilisi yumwe hali maelufu ga wahilisi wa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">koluta kumtanza munhu ayo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:23">kumlajila mbuli igoloche ya kudita,<verse eid="JOB 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 33:24" />leka yamonele isungu na kumlonjela Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">‘Mgombole leka yaleche kwinjila kuli ikulubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:24">namhata chinhu cha kulipa kwa chiwalo cha kumgombola.’<verse eid="JOB 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 33:25" />Ahyo lukuli lwa heye loditigwa kuwa lunyale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:25">kohilusilwa mong'ho wa heye wa usongolo.<verse eid="JOB 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 33:26" />Hamba komlanda Nguluwi na kokundigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">kokuya hali heye kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:26">na Nguluwi komhilusila hachi ya heye.<verse eid="JOB 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 33:27" />Kosechelela hali wanhu na kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">‘Nandita gehile na kwajiliza hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:27">ila Nguluwi hangazile kwa kiwhana na ago.<verse eid="JOB 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 33:28" />Nguluwi nakangombola leka ndeche kwinjila kuli ikulubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:28">nani ndangusangalala kwa chiwalo cha lumuli.’<verse eid="JOB 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 33:29" />“Nguluwi kangumditilaga munhu aga geng'ha chila mhela.<verse eid="JOB 33:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 33:30" />Kangumloholaga munhu yaleche kudumigwa kuli ikulubila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:30">leka yalone lumuli lwa kikala.<verse eid="JOB 33:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 33:31" />“Uhulichize Ayubu, unyhulichize goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:31">winyamalile, nani ndolonga.<verse eid="JOB 33:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 33:32" />Wone kuna ulonzi, unyhidichile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:32">ulonje, kwa vila ndangugana wavizele kwahela nongwa.<verse eid="JOB 33:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 33:33" />Ama winyamalile unyhulichize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 33:33">usindamale, nani ndikulanguse luhala.”<verse eid="JOB 33:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="JOB 34" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kangulonga kuwala hachi ya Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 34:1" />Hamba Elihu nakalutilila kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 34:2" />“Mhulichize ulonzi wa heni hemwe muwele na luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:2">mnyhulichize goya hemwe muwele na uwanzi,<verse eid="JOB 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 34:3" />kwa vila ikutu lyangupimaga ulonzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:3">kota vila umyango vyoulingujezaga chilyo.<verse eid="JOB 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 34:4" />Lelo, tihagulile gawele ga hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:4">natwe tilanguse hamwe gawele ganojile.<verse eid="JOB 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 34:5" />Lelo Ayubu nakalonga, ‘Ndahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:5">Nguluwi nakambusila hachi ya heni.<verse eid="JOB 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 34:6" />Hanga ndahela nongwa, ndangoneka kota nda mdesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:6">magazo ga heni hagalingumala hanga ndahela nongwa.’<verse eid="JOB 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 34:7" />Hana munhu yoneche yawele kota Ayubu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:7">Kwa heye, kuliga ndo ubewe kota kunwa mazi.<verse eid="JOB 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 34:8" />Kanguwaga hamwe na walingudita gehile</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:8">kangujendaga na wehile.<verse eid="JOB 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 34:9" />Kwa vila nakalonga, ‘Munhu halingupata mzidi woneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:9">hoyochitunya leka kumnojeza Nguluwi.’<verse eid="JOB 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 34:10" />“Ahyo mnyhulichize hemwe mlingidita kota mwanguvizela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Mazuwa gose Nguluwi halingudita wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:10">Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali howeza kudita gehile.<verse eid="JOB 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 34:11" />Nguluwi komlipa munhu kwa kiwhana na madito ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:11">kwa kiwhana na nzila za heye.<verse eid="JOB 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 34:12" />Ndo kukomya ng'hatu, Nguluwi halingudita mbuli zihile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:12">Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali halingwajiliza hachi,<verse eid="JOB 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 34:13" />haduhu yoneche yampele ludali lwa kuilongoza isi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:13">Mazuwa gose heye ndo mlolezi wa isi yeng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 34:14" />Wone Nguluwi yahaholile muhe wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:14">muhe uwele nakauwika mgati mwa hetwe,<verse eid="JOB 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 34:15" />wanhu weng'ha wahabagame hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:15">naye munhu yahahiluche mnhimbwisi.<verse eid="JOB 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 34:16" />“Wone hegwe Ayubu kuna luhala uhulichize ali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:16">uhulichize achi chondilingulonga.<verse eid="JOB 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 34:17" />Ndaze, Nguluwi yawele kanguilongoza isi kwa malajizo ga heye kanguizudila hachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:17">Ndaze, hegwe koweza kumtagusa yatanganiche, yawele na mong'ho kota kana nongwa?<verse eid="JOB 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 34:18" />Heye ndo yalinguwalonjela wandewa, ‘Hemwe hamlingutanza chinhu,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:18">na wanhu wakulu, ‘Hemwe mwa wehile!’<verse eid="JOB 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 34:19" />Halinguwaganilila wakulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">ne wawele na lufufu kusinda wazunwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:19">kwa vila awo weng'ha ndo mijito ja moko ga heye.<verse eid="JOB 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 34:20" />Wangubagama baho du nechilo ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">wanhu wangutigasigwa nawo wangugwa na kwajilila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:20">wazidahe wangusigwa ne mong'ho wa munhu.<verse eid="JOB 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 34:21" />“Meho ga Nguluwi gangugona madito geng'ha ga wanhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:21">heye kanguzonaga nzila za hewo zeng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 34:22" />Haduhuli honhu hawele na jiza totolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:22">hawele walingudita wihe wanguweza kivisa.<verse eid="JOB 34:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 34:23" />Nguluwi halingugana kumzelesa munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:23">hoyogana kumtagusa.<verse eid="JOB 34:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 34:24" />Kanguwadumyaga wawele na mong'ho ne kuuza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:24">na kuwawika wanji hali honhu ha hewo,<verse eid="JOB 34:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 34:25" />kwa vila kangugonaga madito ga hewo geng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:25">kanguwosaga nechilo na kuwadumya.<verse eid="JOB 34:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 34:26" />Kanguwagazaga kwa chiwalo cha wihe wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:26">honhu hawele chila yumwe koweza kuwona hewo,<verse eid="JOB 34:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 34:27" />kwa vila nawaleka kumuwinza heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:27">hawakundile kuwinza nzila za heye zeng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 34:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 34:28" />Nawambuza chililo cha mzunwa chimfichile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:28">Nguluwi nakahulika chililo cha yalingubunzwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 34:29" />Wone Nguluwi yanyamalile, haduhu munhu yawele koweza kumng'ung'utila.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Wone kovisa kumeho kwa heye, towa tulihela utanzi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:29">Wone ndo wanhu wa isi ama munhu yumwe, kwa heye ndo chinhu chimwe,<verse eid="JOB 34:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 34:30" />leka kumlemeza mwihe kulongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:30">ama wala walinguwawichilaga wanhu midiwa.<verse eid="JOB 34:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 34:31" />“Wone munhu komlonjela Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:31">‘Dedede ndina nongwa, ila siwila kahi kudita gehile.<verse eid="JOB 34:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 34:32" />Ndajile gehile gohambembeze kugona</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:32">wone nandita gehile siwila kahi.’<verse eid="JOB 34:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 34:33" />Ndaze Ayubu, Nguluwi koganigwa kumgaza kota vyoulingugana?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">Hegwe ndo ulingwamula, siwele heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:33">lelo, ulonje choulingijesa.<verse eid="JOB 34:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 34:34" />Munhu yoneche yawele na nyhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:34">na chila yawele na luhala yalingunyhulichiza, kondonjela,<verse eid="JOB 34:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 34:35" />‘Ayubu kangulonga ne luhala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:35">ulonzi wa heye haulingutanza chinhu.’<verse eid="JOB 34:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 34:36" />Ndahaganile Ayubu yagazigwe ng'hatu mbaka kuduma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:36">kwa vila kangwidichila kota wanhu wehile.<verse eid="JOB 34:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 34:37" />Kangonjeza kubelenhuka kuli gehile ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">kangutowa vimbamba hali hetwe kwa kulajila kubeza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 34:37">na konjeza ng'hatu ulonzi wa heye kumlonjeleza Nguluwi.”<verse eid="JOB 34:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="JOB 35" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kangung'ung'uta kwa chiwalo cha munhu kiwona kota kana hachi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 35:1" />Elihu nakalonga,<verse eid="JOB 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 35:2" />“Ayubu, kwangijesa kota mbuli ayi ndo ya hachi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:2">Hegwe kwangulonga, ‘Ndahela nongwa hali Nguluwi,’<verse eid="JOB 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 35:3" />ila kwanguuza, ‘Namhata mzidi whachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:3">ama ganojile gachi kulawa kwa hegwe kusinda kuleka kudita gehile?’<verse eid="JOB 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 35:4" />“Ndokwidichila hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:4">hamwe na goloko wa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 35:5" />Ulole kilanga tandi leka wone,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:5">ulole ng'hungugu vyoiwele mchanya ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 35:6" />Ndaze, wone kodita gehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:6">ama wonjeze gehile ga hegwe, kwangijesa komlumiza Nguluwi?<verse eid="JOB 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 35:7" />Kota hegwe kwa yatanganiche, ndaze, kwangumha choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:7">ama heye kangubochela mzidi wachi kulawa kwa hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 35:8" />Wihe wa hegwe womlumiza munhu kota hegwe hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:8">na hachi ya hegwe yomnojeza munhu hela.<verse eid="JOB 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 35:9" />“Kuli mhela wa magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">chila munhu kangulila kwa chiwalo cha magazo menji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:9">wangulandaga utanzi kulawa kuli moko uwele na mong'ho.<verse eid="JOB 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 35:10" />Ila haduhu yalingulonga, ‘Kakohi Nguluwi yalumbile heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:10">yalingundita ndiwe ndikwimba mhela wa magazo,<verse eid="JOB 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 35:11" />heye yalingutulangusa lukami kusinda migongolo ja isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:11">na kutudita tuwe na luhala kusinda videje vya kilanga?’<verse eid="JOB 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 35:12" />“Wanhu wangulila kwa kulanda utanzi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">ila Nguluwi halinguwahulichiza hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:12">kwa vila walingulila ndo walingidaya na wehile.<verse eid="JOB 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 35:13" />Ena, Nguluwi halinguhulichiza kulanda kwa hewo kwa hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:13">Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali halingijesa kuwala chililo acho.<verse eid="JOB 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 35:14" />Lelo, houmumng'ung'utila kwa kulonga kota hulingumona Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">na kumlonjela heye kota kwangubeteza kwamula kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:14">Nguluwi hokuhulichiza ne kukwidichila.<verse eid="JOB 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 35:15" />Kwangijesa kota Nguluwi halingugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:15">na halingijesa kuwala gehile,<verse eid="JOB 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 35:16" />Ayubu, kwangugubula mlomo kulonga ulonzi wa hihi hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 35:16">kwangulonga ulonzi winji ulihela nyhala.”<verse eid="JOB 35:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="JOB 36" />
  <para style="s">Elihu kangukutogola kunoga kwa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 36:1" />Elihu nakalutilila kulonga,<verse eid="JOB 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 36:2" />“Unyimilile hado kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:2">ndina ulonzi winji kahi wa kulonga, honhu ha Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 36:3" />Ndokulonjela chondichilanguse kulawa honhu halivinji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:3">leka ndikulajile kota Nguluwi, yawele nakangongomanya kana hachi.<verse eid="JOB 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 36:4" />Ndikomya, ulonzi wa heni hauwele wa udesi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:4">heni ndilingwima hali hegwe, ndina uwanzi wa kukomya.<verse eid="JOB 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 36:5" />“Uhulichize, Nguluwi ndo yawele na mong'ho ng'hatu na halingumbeza munhu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:5">kanguchizela chila chinhu.<verse eid="JOB 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 36:6" />Halinguwalechela wehile walutilile kikala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:6">ila kanguwapaga walingubunzigwa hachi ya hewo.<verse eid="JOB 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 36:7" />Kanguwamilaga wawele na hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">kanguwaditaga wekalise kuli vigoda vya undewa hamwe na wandewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:7">na kuwapa lutogo mazuwa gose.<verse eid="JOB 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 36:8" />Ila wone wanhu nawawohigwa na minyololo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:8">wawele webatililwe na ng'weso za magazo,<verse eid="JOB 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 36:9" />kanguwalajilaga gehile ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:9">na kota hewo ndo wanhu walingidaya.<verse eid="JOB 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 36:10" />Kanguwaditaga wahulichize makanyo ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:10">na kuwalajiza kuleka gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 36:11" />Wone womuhulichiza na kumkolela mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">mbuli za hewo zolutilila goya kuli mazuwa ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:11">na miyaka ja hewo jeng'ha jowa ja kusangalala.<verse eid="JOB 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 36:12" />Ila wone hawohulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">wodumigwa kwa ipanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:12">nawo wobagama kwa vila nawali walihela uwanzi.<verse eid="JOB 36:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 36:13" />“Wohambe wamdumbe Nguluwi, wanguvisaga ng'halazi mnhumbula za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:13">mbaka hoyowagaza, hawalingulanda utanzi.<verse eid="JOB 36:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 36:14" />Wangubagama wang'hali wasongolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:14">kwa chiwalo cha soni na madito ga hewo gehile.<verse eid="JOB 36:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 36:15" />Ila Nguluwi kanguwaloholaga walingugazika kulawa kuli magazo ga hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:15">na kilajila kwa hewo kwa kukolela magazo ga hewo.<verse eid="JOB 36:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 36:16" />Ayubu, Nguluwi nakakulavya kulawa kuli magazo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">na kukudita usangalale kuli kikala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:16">mchisaga cha hegwe nakwali na vilyo vinji na vinonile.<verse eid="JOB 36:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 36:17" />“Ila sambi nakutagusigwa kota yehile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:17">utaguso wa hachi naukufika.<verse eid="JOB 36:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 36:18" />Wilolele, uleche kubochela sendi leka wajilize hachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:18">ama ukulu wa lufufu lukwajilize.<verse eid="JOB 36:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 36:19" />Mong'ho wa hegwe na lufufu lwa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:19">haviweza kukuwika kutali na magazo.<verse eid="JOB 36:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 36:20" />Uleche kugana mhela wa nechilo wuye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">leka Nguluwi yaleche kukona na kukugaza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:20">kwa vila nechilo ndo mhela uwele wanhu wangudumigwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 36:21" />Wilolele! Uleche kugalamchila wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:21">nakupegwa magazo leka kukuwika kutali na wihe.<verse eid="JOB 36:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 36:22" />Ukumbuchile ukulu wa ludali lwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:22">haduhu yawele yoweza kumlangusa heye.<verse eid="JOB 36:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 36:23" />Haduhu ne yumwe yawele nakamlonjela Nguluwi chinhu cha kudita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:23">ama kumlonjela, ‘Nakuwifya!’<verse eid="JOB 36:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 36:24" />“Wanji nawamtogola Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">kwa gala goyaditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:24">nagwe wilumbe na hewo kumtogola.<verse eid="JOB 36:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 36:25" />Wanhu weng'ha nawagona goyaditile Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:25">ila mhela wunji toweza kugona hela kulawa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 36:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 36:26" />Nguluwi ndo mkulu ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">kusinda kuvizela kwa hetwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:26">miyaka ja kikala kwa heye hajilinguwazigwa.<verse eid="JOB 36:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 36:27" />Kangugakwega kuchanya kwa heye mazi ga bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:27">na kulawa kuli ikunguyosi kanguditaga midovu ja nhonya.<verse eid="JOB 36:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 36:28" />Kanguditaga ng'hungugu zilavye mazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:28">nayo nhonya yanguwatowelaga wanhu.<verse eid="JOB 36:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 36:29" />Whaani yalinguvizela ndaze ng'hungugu vyoilingutandazulwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:29">ama limlungu vyolilingubuma kilanga kwa heye?<verse eid="JOB 36:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 36:30" />Ulole, ndaze vyoyalingulweneza lumwemwesa lwa limlungu hali heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:30">na kuhagubika mgati ng'hatu ha bahali.<verse eid="JOB 36:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 36:31" />Ahyo ndo vyoyalinguwalongoza wanhu muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:31">na kutigalila chilyo chinji lukami.<verse eid="JOB 36:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 36:32" />Yangujesigwa kota kanguumemezaga moko wa heye kwa lumwemwesa lwa limlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:32">na kululajiza lutowe hali honhu hoyalingugana heye.<verse eid="JOB 36:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 36:33" />Limlungu lyanguwikula kuya kwa chivuluvumbi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 36:33">mbaka migongolo janguvizelaga kota kanguya.”<verse eid="JOB 36:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="JOB 37" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 37:1" />“Kwa chiwalo cha ago geng'ha, nhumbula ya heni yangukakama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:1">nayo yanguzuma kulawa honhu hake.<verse eid="JOB 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 37:2" />Mhulichize lizi lya Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:2">kubuma kulingulawa kuli mlomo wa heye.<verse eid="JOB 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 37:3" />Kangululechelaga lumwemwesa lwa limlungu hasi ha ulanga weng'ha</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:3">na kulweneza mbaka kuli banzi zeng'ha za isi.<verse eid="JOB 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 37:4" />Hamba lizi lyangubumaga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">lizi lya Nguluwi lyangubumaga kwa ukulu wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:4">na mhela awo weng'ha lumwemwesa lwangupulikaga.<verse eid="JOB 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 37:5" />Nguluwi hoyolonga, mbuli za kububuwaza zangulawila kota vila limlungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:5">kanguditaga mbuli ng'hulu zohambe tuzizele.<verse eid="JOB 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 37:6" />Kanguilajizaga seluji kugwa kuli misanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:6">na nhonya ng'hulu itowe.<verse eid="JOB 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 37:7" />Hoyodita ahyo kangujilemezaga mijito ja wanhu kukoleka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:7">leka wanhu weng'ha wavizele kota heye nakadita ahyo.<verse eid="JOB 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 37:8" />Nhonya hoitowa, migongolo ja kisolo jangulutaga kuli honhu ha kivisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:8">jangikalaga kuko mbaka nhonya hoimala.<verse eid="JOB 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 37:9" />Chivuluvumbi changulawaga kuli honhu hake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:9">chipute changulawaga kuli mbeho ilinguluta hima.<verse eid="JOB 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 37:10" />Lweselo lwa Nguluwi lwangulavyaga balafu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:10">honhu hakulu ha mazi hangugagadala kota maganga.<verse eid="JOB 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 37:11" />Nguluwi kangumemezaga midovu minji kuli ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:11">ng'hungugu yangusambalulaga lumwemwesa lwake.<verse eid="JOB 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 37:12" />Nayo ng'hungugu yanguzungulutaga kwa malajizo ga heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">mchanya mwa isi yeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:12">yangudita choneche choyolajiza.<verse eid="JOB 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 37:13" />Nguluwi kangugalaga nhonya kuli isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:13">leka kutugaza ama kulajila igano lya heye lya kwimilila.<verse eid="JOB 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 37:14" />“Ayubu, kwanguganigwa kuhulichiza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:14">unyamalile na wijese kuwala vinduzanduza vya Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 37:15" />Ndaze, kwanguvizela ndaze Nguluwi vyoyalinguilajiza ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:15">na kuludita lumwemwesa lwa heye lwa limlungu lulavye lumuli?<verse eid="JOB 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 37:16" />Ndaze, kwanguvizela ndaze ng'hungugu vyoilingwelela kuli ulanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:16">Ajo ndo mijito ja kububuwaza ja yula yawele muwanzi ng'hatu!<verse eid="JOB 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 37:17" />Hegwe ulingiwona kota nakuvala nguwo ziwele na ivuche ng'hatu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:17">mhela mbeho ya ivuche lya kusini yanguivaba isi,<verse eid="JOB 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 37:18" />ndaze, koweza kuutandazula ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:18">na kuudita uwe lugagadala kota chilolelo cha shaba?<verse eid="JOB 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 37:19" />“Ayubu, mlangusa mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">utulanguse choni chotulinguganigwa kumlonjela Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:19">hatuuzelele ulonzi wa kulonga.<verse eid="JOB 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 37:20" />Ndaze, ndimlonjele Nguluwi kota ndangugana kulongasa na heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:20">Hebu, kwa vila wone ndite ahyo, koweza kundumya.<verse eid="JOB 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 37:21" />Lelo haduhu yawele koweza kulilola isanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">vyolilingupulika goya kuli ulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:21">mbeho hoiwa yusile ng'hungugu yeng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 37:22" />Kulawa kasikazini, Nguluwi kanguyaga na lumuli lulingupulika kota zahabu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:22">kanguyaga kuli welile wa kudumbiza.<verse eid="JOB 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 37:23" />Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali halingoneka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">ila mong'ho wake ndo ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:23">na mazuwa gose kangwamulaga kwa hachi.<verse eid="JOB 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 37:24" />Ahyo, wanhu wangumdumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">heye halingijesa kuwala yoneche yalingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 37:24">na kijesa kota kana luhala ng'hatu.”<verse eid="JOB 37:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="JOB 38" />
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kangumwidichila Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 38:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila Ayubu kulawa kuli chivuluvumbi, nakalonga,<verse eid="JOB 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 38:2" />“Hegwe ndo whaani ulingulonga kuwala mbuli za heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:2">kwa ulonzi ulihela uwanzi?<verse eid="JOB 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 38:3" />Wiwiche goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:3">ndokuuza, nagwe kwanguganigwa unyhidichile.<verse eid="JOB 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 38:4" />Nawali kohi londijiwichile misisi ja isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:4">Ndonjele wone kuna kuvizela.<verse eid="JOB 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 38:5" />Whaani yawichile vipimilo vyake?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Ndikomya, hegwe kwanguvizela!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:5">Whaani yawele nakagolosa ng'weso ya kupimila mchanya mwake?<verse eid="JOB 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 38:6" />Ndaze, misisi jake najiwichigwa mchanya mwa choni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:6">ama whaani yaliwichile iganga likulu lya msisi,<verse eid="JOB 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 38:7" />mhela nhondwe za mitondo lozimbile hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:7">na wahilisi wa Nguluwi lowawele wotowa iyowe kwa kusangalala?<verse eid="JOB 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 38:8" />Mhela bahali loibohole mazi kulawa mgati mwa isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:8">whaani yawele nakagalemeza mazi ago galutilile kubohoka?<verse eid="JOB 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 38:9" />Heni ndo ndiigubiche bahali kwa ng'hungugu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:9">na kuiwichila jiza totolo.<verse eid="JOB 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 38:10" />Nandiiwichila bahali mbaka jake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:10">na lwizi na mhajilo,<verse eid="JOB 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 38:11" />hamba nandiilonjela, ‘Kuduma kwa hegwe ndo hano!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:11">Nhigu za hegwe ziwele na mong'ho zodumila hano!’<verse eid="JOB 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 38:12" />“Ayubu, ndaze nakuwahika kukulonjela kubwemwenzuka kwaluche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:12">nako nakukuhulichiza?<verse eid="JOB 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 38:13" />Ndaze, nakuwahika kukulajiza kubwemwenzuka kulutilile muisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:13">na kuwambuza wehile leka wabilimile kuli honhu hawo ha uviso?<verse eid="JOB 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 38:14" />Isi yangugaluka na kupata lanji kuli mhela wa kubwemwenzuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:14">na kulajila vidunda na mibindi.<verse eid="JOB 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 38:15" />Ila lumuli lwake lwangulangaza lukami</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:15">kwa wala wehile na mong'ho wawo wangubenigwa.<verse eid="JOB 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 38:16" />“Ayubu, ndaze nakuwahika kufika kuli nzasa za bahali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:16">ama kujenda mgati ng'hatu mwa mazi?<verse eid="JOB 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 38:17" />Ndaze, nakuwahika kulajilwa lwizi ja kuli isi ya wabagame,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:17">lwizi jiwele kuli jiza totolo?<verse eid="JOB 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 38:18" />Ndaze, kwanguuzela ukulu wa isi?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:18">Ndonjele wone kwangugazela aga geng'ha.<verse eid="JOB 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 38:19" />Ndaze, kwanguhazela haluga ha lumuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:19">ama jiza kolilingikala?<verse eid="JOB 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 38:20" />Ndaze, koweza kundajila?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:20">Kwanguizela nzila ya kuluta ako?<verse eid="JOB 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 38:21" />Ndangukomya koweza, kwa vila hegwe kuna miyaka minji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:21">na nawali baho mhela isi loiwele ilumbigwa!<verse eid="JOB 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 38:22" />Ndaze, nakuwahika kwinjila kuli ng'hano ya seluji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:22">ama kuzona ng'hano za nhonya ya maganga,<verse eid="JOB 38:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 38:23" />ziwele nandiziwika kwa chiwalo cha kuwatanza wanhu wa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:23">lowowa kuli magazo, kuli mhela wa kitowa ngondo?<verse eid="JOB 38:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 38:24" />Kwanguizela nzila ya kuluta kuli mwaluko wa lumuli?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:24">Kwa kohi haluga ha mbeho ya kolilawilaga isanya?<verse eid="JOB 38:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 38:25" />Whaani yabawile vikolola kwa chiwalo cha nhonya kulawa kilanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:25">Whaani yagongomanyile nzila kwa chiwalo cha lumwemwesa lwa limlungu?<verse eid="JOB 38:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 38:26" />Whaani yaiditile nhonya kutowa kuli kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:26">hali honhu hawele haduhu munhu yalingikala?<verse eid="JOB 38:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 38:27" />Whaani yailajize nhonya ilingudita isi idode,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">kuli honhu hawele na mizuchila michefu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:27">na kujidita misolo jote kahi?<verse eid="JOB 38:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 38:28" />Ndaze, nhonya ina mhaza?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:28">Whaani nakajilela midovu ja nungwi?<verse eid="JOB 38:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 38:29" />Balafu yangulawa kuli lida lya whaani?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:29">Whaani yailelile seluji ilingulawa kuli ulanga?<verse eid="JOB 38:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 38:30" />Mhela wa chipute, mazi ga ilamba gangugaluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:30">ganguwa gagagadale kota iganga.<verse eid="JOB 38:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 38:31" />Ndaze, kwanguweza kuchiwoha kwa minyololo chilundo cha nhondwe chilinguchemigwa Kilimiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:31">ama kulejeza vihindo vya Olioni?<verse eid="JOB 38:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 38:32" />Ndaze, kwanguweza kuvilongoza vilundo vya nhondwe kwa mhela wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:32">ama kuzilongoza nhondwe za ulanga wa kasikazini zilinguchemigwa Idubu?<verse eid="JOB 38:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 38:33" />Ndaze, kwangujizela mizilo jilingulongoza ulanga?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:33">Ndaze, kwanguweza kulajila ludali lwake muisi?<verse eid="JOB 38:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 38:34" />“Ayubu, ndaze kwanguweza kulandula lizi mbaka kuli ng'hungugu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:34">leka kigubika gwegwe baho kwa mazi?<verse eid="JOB 38:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="JOB 38:35" />Ndaze, wone ululonjele lumwemwesa lwa limlungu lulangaze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:35">lokuya na kulonga, ‘Nda hano’?<verse eid="JOB 38:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JOB 38:36" />Whaani yaipele nhumbula luhala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:36">ama mutwi kuweza kuvizela?<verse eid="JOB 38:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="JOB 38:37" />Whaani yawele na luhala lwa kuwaza ng'hungugu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:37">Whaani yalinguweza kujinamiza mibuli ja kilanga,<verse eid="JOB 38:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="JOB 38:38" />mhela nhimbwisi hoiwa hamwe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:38">na ilongo hoihanzanya na kuwa nhope?<verse eid="JOB 38:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="JOB 38:39" />Ndaze, kopelemba kwa chiwalo cha isimba idala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:39">na kudita misimba jiwele na nzala jigute,<verse eid="JOB 38:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="JOB 38:40" />mhela hewo wesuate kuli mhalika zawo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:40">ama wovizila kuli visosolo?<verse eid="JOB 38:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JOB 38:41" />Whaani yalingulipa ibondwa chilyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">mhela mibofu jake jangundilila heni Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 38:41">hojilingulubaluba kwa vila jahela chilyo?”<verse eid="JOB 38:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="JOB 39" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 39:1" />“Ayubu, ndaze kwanguuzela mhela wa mhelele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:1">ama wa ibala kulela?<verse eid="JOB 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 39:2" />Ndaze, kwanguvizela kota wanguwa na himila kwa mhela whachi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:2">ama zuwa lya kulela kwangulizela?”<verse eid="JOB 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 39:3" />Mhela wa kulela houfika wangusunzumalaga na kulela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:3">na usungu wa kulela wanguleka.<verse eid="JOB 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 39:4" />Wana wawo wangulutililaga goya na konjezeka mong'ho kuko kisolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:4">hamba wangukaga ne kuhiluka.<verse eid="JOB 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 39:5" />“Whaani yajilechile midogowi ja kisolo jilejehe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:5">Whaani yajidohole ng'weso?<verse eid="JOB 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 39:6" />Heni ndo mbele nandijiwika kugunuche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:6">honhu hawele misolo hajilingukula.<verse eid="JOB 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 39:7" />Janguwa kutali na iyowe lya kuli miji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:7">na kwanguwahela munhu yawele kojidita jizowele kukola mijito ja lupichi.<verse eid="JOB 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 39:8" />Kuli vidunda ndo honhu hawo ha kudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:8">jangupalaga chila chiwele chidodi.<verse eid="JOB 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 39:9" />“Ayubu, ndaze ibogo lyokunda kukukolela mijito,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:9">ama kikala kuli ibani lyako?<verse eid="JOB 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 39:10" />Ndaze, kwanguweza kuliwoha ibogo ng'weso na kulidita lilime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:10">ama likweje ihuka lya kulimila kuli mgunda wa hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 39:11" />Ndaze, kochitumbila kwa vila lina mong'ho winji</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:11">na kulilechela likukolele mijito jing'hang'hale ja hegwe?<verse eid="JOB 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 39:12" />Ndaze, kochitumbila likugalile mbena za hegwe haluga kulawa kumgunda</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:12">na kuzikungajiza kuli honhu hako ha kupululila nyhule?<verse eid="JOB 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 39:13" />“Mbuni kangutowaga mabawa gake kwa kusangalala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:13">ila halinguweza kuguluka kota isakulang'hola.<verse eid="JOB 39:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 39:14" />Mbuni kangulekaga mafinga gake mchanya mwa misanga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:14">leka jipate ivuche kulawa kuli sangalaza,<verse eid="JOB 39:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 39:15" />ne kijesa kota joweza kubigangwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:15">ama kuwifigwa na migongolo ja kisolo.<verse eid="JOB 39:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 39:16" />Kangujiditila mafinga gake kota mafinga ga yunji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:16">na kudita mong'ho wake kuwa wa hihi hela,<verse eid="JOB 39:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 39:17" />kwa vila heni Nguluwi nandimdita mbuni yawe mpoka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:17">simpele honhu honeche ha luhala.<verse eid="JOB 39:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 39:18" />Ila hoyokwaluka kubilima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">kangumsekaga falasi na yakwinile kuli falasi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:18">kwa vila falasi halingubilima himahima kusinda mbuni.<verse eid="JOB 39:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 39:19" />“Ayubu wijese kuwala falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">ndaze, hegwe ndo nakuwapa falasi mong'ho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:19">ama hegwe ndo nakuwadita wawe na milaika ng'wemang'wema msingo?<verse eid="JOB 39:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 39:20" />Ndaze, hegwe ndo nakuwadita falasi waguluche kota nzije?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:20">Mhela lowolila kwa lizi likulu wanguwadita wanhu wadumbe.<verse eid="JOB 39:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 39:21" />Wangupanangapananga kuli misanga, wosangalala kwa chiwalo cha mong'ho wa hewo ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:21">wochiwika goya kubilimila kuli ngondo.<verse eid="JOB 39:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 39:22" />Falasi wangulusekaga lunhwinhwi, hawalingudumba choneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:22">ne kulibilima ipanga.<verse eid="JOB 39:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 39:23" />Vinhu vya kitowela ngondo vyowalinguvihola walingwendesa falasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:23">vyangulavya lizi lya kutigasika na kupulika kuli isanya.<verse eid="JOB 39:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 39:24" />Falasi wangulutaga kumwando kuno isi yokakama kwa ng'halazi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:24">mhalamhanda hoilila, wangubilimila.<verse eid="JOB 39:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 39:25" />Howohulika lizi lya mhalamanda wangulila, ‘Aha!’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">Wangupataga unhunyhililo wa ngondo kulawa kutali,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:25">lizi lya chilongozi na iyowe lya ngondo.<verse eid="JOB 39:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 39:26" />“Ayubu, ndaze ibondwa nalilangusa kwa hegwe kuguluka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:26">na kugolosa mabawa gake kuluta kusini?<verse eid="JOB 39:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 39:27" />Ndaze, ikungule lyangugulukaga kilanga kwa malajizo ga hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:27">na kuzenga chimvulila chake honhu ha kuchanya?<verse eid="JOB 39:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 39:28" />Lyangikalaga mchanya mwa mitalawe jiling'wemang'wema,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:28">mitalawe jiwele na chihomo ndo ngome yake.<verse eid="JOB 39:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 39:29" />Kulawa ako lyangupalaga upelembi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:29">meho gake ganguwonaga kulawa kutali.<verse eid="JOB 39:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 39:30" />Hawele na itufi ndo lyanguzungulutaga baho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 39:30">mibofu jake jangufyomaga danda.”<verse eid="JOB 39:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="JOB 40" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 40:1" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakalutilila kumlonjela Ayubu,<verse eid="JOB 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 40:2" />“Ndaze, hegwe ulingulola nongwa kochitwanza na Nguluwi Yawele na Ludali?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:2">Ulingung'ung'uta kwa chiwalo cha Nguluwi lelo widichile!”<verse eid="JOB 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 40:3" />Aho Ayubu nakamwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi, yolonga,<verse eid="JOB 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 40:4" />“Heni siwele chinhu, silinguweza kwidichila chinhu choneche hali hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:4">ndanguuwika moko wa heni kuli mlomo wa heni.<verse eid="JOB 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 40:5" />Nanjeza kulonga ila silonga kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:5">ena nang'hangaza kulonga ila silutilila kulonga kahi.”<verse eid="JOB 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kangumuuza kahi Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 40:6" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakamwidichila Ayubu kulawa kuli chivuluvumbi, nakalonga,<verse eid="JOB 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 40:7" />“Wiwiche goya kuhulichiza gwa Ayubu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:7">ndokuuza nagwe kwanguganigwa unyhidichile.<verse eid="JOB 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 40:8" />Ndaze, kwangujeza kilajila kota kwahela nongwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:8">kwa kung'ung'utila heni kota siditile hachi?<verse eid="JOB 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 40:9" />Ndaze, kuna mong'ho kota heni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:9">Ndaze, koweza kulavya lizi lya kubuma kota lya heni?<verse eid="JOB 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 40:10" />Lelo, wilajile kota kuna kuhulichiza na ukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:10">winolije kwa lutogo na ukulu.<verse eid="JOB 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 40:11" />Ulajile kuzudila kwa hegwe kukulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:11">umpale chila yawele na ujuvi na kumgwisa.<verse eid="JOB 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 40:12" />Umlole chila yalingidaya na kumdulisa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:12">uwahondange wehile honhu howawele.<verse eid="JOB 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 40:13" />Uwatile weng'ha mnhimbwisi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:13">uwahiliche kuli isi ya wabagame.<verse eid="JOB 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 40:14" />Aho ndo nene baha ndokutogola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:14">na kulonga kota mong'ho wa hegwe woweza kukulohola.<verse eid="JOB 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 40:15" />“Ulilole igongolo likulu lilinguchemigwa Behemoti,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">lyondililumbile kota vyondikulumbile hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:15">Igongolo alyo lyangulyaga misolo kota isenga,<verse eid="JOB 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 40:16" />ila lukuli lwake luna mong'ho lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:16">na midanha ja lida lyake ja nzinzili.<verse eid="JOB 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 40:17" />Mchila wake wangiwhana kota igodi lya mwelezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:17">midanha ja mahaza gake ja nzinzili.<verse eid="JOB 40:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 40:18" />Mizeje jake ja nzinzili kota mibomba ja shaba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:18">vitomo vyake ndo kota fito za chuma.<verse eid="JOB 40:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 40:19" />Alyo ndo liwele na mong'ho lukami kusinda vilumbigwe vya heni vyeng'ha!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:19">Yalilumbile yaliyeka ndo yalinguweza kulisumya.<verse eid="JOB 40:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 40:20" />Vidunda vyangulavyaga chilyo chake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:20">najo migongolo jeng'ha ja kisolo jangudawalaga habehi na alyo.<verse eid="JOB 40:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 40:21" />Lyanguwasaga hali visosolo vya miwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:21">honhu hake ha kivisa ndo kuli misolo ja ilamba.<verse eid="JOB 40:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 40:22" />Avyo visosolo vya miwa na migodi jiwele najota kuli vikolola,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:22">jangumha honhu ha kikala kwa lubehelo lwake.<verse eid="JOB 40:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 40:23" />Mhela lwanda loumema lukami, alyo halilingudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:23">halilingutinhuka hanga lwanda lwa Yolodani lomema ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 40:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 40:24" />Ndaze, whaani yoweza kulibata alyo kuno liwele meho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 40:24">ama kuligwiliza kwa idiwa na kutubula mhenyelo yake?<verse eid="JOB 40:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="JOB 41" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 41:1" />“Ayubu, ndaze kwanguweza kulilowa Lewiyatani, linhu lya kuli bahali kwa ndowano ilingulowa somba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:1">ama kuwoha umyango wake kwa ng'weso?<verse eid="JOB 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 41:2" />Ndaze, kwanguweza kwinjiza ng'weso mmhenyhelo yake leka kulilongoza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:2">ama kutubula izeze lyake kwa ndowano?<verse eid="JOB 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 41:3" />Ndaze, lyokulanda ulyonele isungu?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:3">Ndaze, lyolongasa na hegwe kwa ulonzi wa uliholile leka uleche kulilumiza?”<verse eid="JOB 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 41:4" />Ndaze, lyodita ilagano na hegwe leka ulihole</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:4">liwe chitumagwa wa hegwe kuli kikala kwake kweng'ha?<verse eid="JOB 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 41:5" />Ndaze, koliwika haluga ha hegwe na kulidita livine na hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:5">ama koliwoha ng'weso kwa chiwalo cha wahinza leka wadawale nalyo?<verse eid="JOB 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 41:6" />Ndaze, walingugula na kuguza vinhu woligula kulawa kwa walingulowa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:6">na kulitemanga vihande vihande na kuguza miwunde jake?<verse eid="JOB 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 41:7" />Ndaze, kwanguweza kuhoma lukuli lwake kwa igoha lya kuswandila somba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:7">ama kulihoma litwi lyake kwa chinhu chiwele na chihomo?<verse eid="JOB 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 41:8" />Wone kolidoliza kwa moko wa hegwe, lyokuditila ngondo iwele koikumbuchila mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:8">na hauwila kahi kudita ahyo!<verse eid="JOB 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 41:9" />Kitumbila koneche kwa kulidita lisindamale ndo kideteleza hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:9">kula kulilola hela kwangumgwisa munhu hasi.<verse eid="JOB 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 41:10" />Haduhu yoneche yalinguweza kulyinula.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:10">Lelo, whaani yoweza kwima hali heni?<verse eid="JOB 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 41:11" />Whaani yalingundai leka ndimhilusile?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:11">Chila chiwele hasi ha ulanga ndo cha heni.<verse eid="JOB 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 41:12" />“Ayubu, ndokulonjela kuwala vitomo vya linhu alyo, Lewiyatani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:12">mong'ho wake na lukuli lwake lukulu.<verse eid="JOB 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 41:13" />Whaani yalinguweza kulavya igozi lyake ligagadale?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:13">Ndo whaani yalinguweza kulihejelela na lijamu kwa kulilongoza?<verse eid="JOB 41:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 41:14" />Ndaze, whaani yoweza kugubula mlomo wa alyo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:14">uwele nauzungulutwa na mizino ja kukabusa?<verse eid="JOB 41:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 41:15" />Mgongo wake una ngawo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:15">zibatilize hamwe ziwele nzinzili,<verse eid="JOB 41:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 41:16" />chila yimwe ya habehi ng'hatu na iyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:16">haduhuli mbeho ilinguweza kukola hagati.<verse eid="JOB 41:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 41:17" />Ngawo azo nazilumba nzinzili chila imwe na iyage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:17">nazinanahila, hazilingileka.<verse eid="JOB 41:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JOB 41:18" />Holigubula mhenyelo yake, lumuli lwangumetameta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:18">meho gake gangupulika kota kubwemwenzuka.<verse eid="JOB 41:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JOB 41:19" />Vyenje vilingwaka vyangulawa kuli mlomo wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:19">misesela ja chiluli janguzuma kulawa mgati mwake.<verse eid="JOB 41:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JOB 41:20" />Iyosi lyangufung'ha kulawa kuli mhenyelo yake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:20">kota ivuche lilingulawa kuli chiya chilingutogota kwa chiluli cha ngodi zikalile za midete.<verse eid="JOB 41:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JOB 41:21" />Lweselo lwake lwangubwinaga makala ga maganga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:21">najo milapi ja chiluli jangulawaga kuli mlomo wake.<verse eid="JOB 41:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JOB 41:22" />Singo yake ina mong'ho lukami,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:22">koneche holiluta lyanguwambuza wanhu wadumbe.<verse eid="JOB 41:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JOB 41:23" />Miwunde jake najibina na kinhanhahila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:23">ja nzinzili na hajilinguweza kusigwa.<verse eid="JOB 41:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JOB 41:24" />Mhambaga yake naigagadala kota italawe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:24">ama iganga lya hanyi lya kubalasila.<verse eid="JOB 41:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JOB 41:25" />Holikwinuka, wawele na mong'ho wangudumba,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:25">wanguhiluka kumbele na kubilima.<verse eid="JOB 41:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JOB 41:26" />Ipanga lilingumfichila hambe limteme,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:26">ne igoha ama msale.<verse eid="JOB 41:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JOB 41:27" />Chuma lyanguchonaga kota isolo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:27">na shaba kota igodi lyolile.<verse eid="JOB 41:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JOB 41:28" />Misale hajilingwambuza libilime,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:28">maganga ga mhembeyo kwake ndo kota mhumba.<verse eid="JOB 41:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JOB 41:29" />Nyhimbati yanguwaga kota chihande cha ihamba likalile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:29">lyangusekaga lizi lya kitowa kwa migoha.<verse eid="JOB 41:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JOB 41:30" />Honhu hake ha hasi kuli lida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">hana mizino kota vigaye vya chiya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">wone zileche ubuluno kuli nhope,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:30">kota chinhu chiwele na mizino ja kupululila.<verse eid="JOB 41:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JOB 41:31" />Holikojelela lyanguditaga mazi ga bahali gehanzanye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:31">kota mazi galinguhemula kuli chiya.<verse eid="JOB 41:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="JOB 41:32" />Holikola kumbele kwake lyangulekaga nzila ilingupulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:32">munhu yahajesile kota hagati ng'hatu ha mazi menji kwa hazelu.<verse eid="JOB 41:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JOB 41:33" />Haduhu choneche muisi chilingiwhana nalyo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:33">alyo ndo chilumbigwe chilihela lunhwinhwi.<verse eid="JOB 41:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JOB 41:34" />“Heye kanguwalolaga hasi wala walingidaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 41:34">heye ndo mndewa mchanya mwa weng'ha walingidaya.”<verse eid="JOB 41:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="JOB 42" />
  <para style="s">Ayubu kangumwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JOB 42:1" />Aho Ayubu nakamwidichila Mkulu Nguluwi.<verse eid="JOB 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JOB 42:2" />“Ndanguvizela kota kwanguweza kudita mbuli zeng'ha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:2">haduhu yoneche yawele koweza kulemeza kiwika goya kwa hegwe.<verse eid="JOB 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JOB 42:3" />Nakuuza, ‘Whaani yalingulonga ulonzi wa chipoka ne uwanzi?’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">Ndikomya nandonga kuwala mbuli zohambe ndizizele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:3">mbuli za kububuwaza ng'hatu kwa heni.<verse eid="JOB 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JOB 42:4" />Nakundonjela, ‘Uhulichize nani ndolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:4">ndokuuza nagwe kwanguganigwa unyidichile.’<verse eid="JOB 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JOB 42:5" />Aho hamwande nanyulika hela mbuli za hegwe kulawa kwa wanji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:5">ila lelo ndangukona kwa meho ga heni.<verse eid="JOB 42:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JOB 42:6" />Lelo ndangona soni kwa chiwalo cha gala geng'ha gawele nandonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JOB 42:6">ndangibakaliza nhimbwisi na mivu kulajila kulonga gehile ga heni.”<verse eid="JOB 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Goloko wa Ayubu wangubasigwa soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JOB 42:7" />Mkulu Nguluwi loyasindile kulongasa na Ayubu, nakamlonjela Elifasi, Mtemani, “Ndina ng'halazi na hegwe na goloko wa hegwe weli, kwa vila hamlonjile ga kukomya kuwala heni, ila chitumagwa wa heni Ayubu nakalonga ga kukomya. <verse eid="JOB 42:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JOB 42:8" />Lelo mhole milogota milume saba na ming'holo milume saba mlute kwa chitumagwa wa heni Ayubu leka mlavye nhambiko za kulakazwa kwa chiwalo cha mwemwe baho. Chitumagwa wa heni Ayubu kolanda kwa chiwalo cha hemwe nani ndokubochela kulanda kwa heye leka ndeche kuwaditila kwa kiwhana na upoka wa hemwe, kwa vila hamlonjile kukomya kuwala heni, ila chitumagwa wa heni Ayubu nakalonga ga kukomya.”<verse eid="JOB 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JOB 42:9" />Lelo Elifasi, Mtemani na Bilidadi, Mshuhi na Sofali, Mnaama, nawadita kota Mkulu Nguluwi vyoyawalonjele, naye Mkulu Nguluwi nakakunda kulanda kwa Ayubu.<verse eid="JOB 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mkulu Nguluwi kangumtambichiza kahi Ayubu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JOB 42:10" />Ayubu loyasindile kulanda kwa chiwalo cha goloko wa heye, Mkulu Nguluwi nakamlohola kulawa kuli kugazika, nakamtambichiza kahi. Mkulu Nguluwi nakamha vinhu mala mbili ya hamwande. <verse eid="JOB 42:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JOB 42:11" />Hamba wang'holoze weng'ha walume na wadala na chila munhu yawele nakamzela aho hamwande, nawaluta kuli ng'handa ya heye na kulya hamwe. Nawamhembuliza kwa chiwalo cha magazo geng'ha gawele nagamfika kwa kwambuzwa na Mkulu Nguluwi. Chila yumwe nakamha sendi na pete ya zahabu.<verse eid="JOB 42:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JOB 42:12" />Mkulu Nguluwi nakajitambichiza miyaka ja kuduma ja kikala kwa Ayubu kusinda jila ja hamwande. Nayali na ming'holo elufu kumi na zine (14,000) na ngamiya elufu sita (6,000) na mibuguma elufu mbili (2,000) na midogowi midala elufu imwe (1,000). <verse eid="JOB 42:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JOB 42:13" />Kahi nayali na wasongolo saba na wahinza wadatu. <verse eid="JOB 42:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JOB 42:14" />Mhinza wake wa mwaluko nayali yochemigwa Yemima na wa keli nayali yochemigwa Kesiya na wa kadatu nayali yochemigwa Keleni-hapuki. <verse eid="JOB 42:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JOB 42:15" />Kuli isi ayo yeng'ha hakuwele na wadala wawele na kumeho kunojile ng'hatu kota wahinza wa Ayubu, naye mhaza wawo nakawapa uhalizi hamwe na kalumbu wa hewo.<verse eid="JOB 42:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JOB 42:16" />Logakolile ago geng'ha Ayubu nakekala miyaka miya imwe na makumi gane (140), nakawona wazukulu wa heye mbaka ivyazi lya kane. <verse eid="JOB 42:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JOB 42:17" />Lelo Ayubu nakabagama yawele sekulu ng'hatu.<verse eid="JOB 42:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JOB 42" />
</usx>